(1489, 1, 'Proverbs and cartoons', 'Reading U2', 1, '', '<H2>Vtipy</h2> Translate these cartoons and identify the use of accusative.     <table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\">       <tr>         <td width=\"60%\">  [$1, textarea 50,3]   </td>         <td width=\"40%\"><img src=\"/tuit/img/reading/prover4.jpg\" width=\"217\" height=\"217><br><b> Smilujte se. MĂĄm Âenu a tĹicet tisĂ­c vajec.</b></td>       </tr>     </table> <p>     <table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\">       <tr>         <td width=\"50%\">  [$1, textarea 40,5]   </td>         <td width=\"50%\"><img src=\"/tuit/img/reading/prover5.gif\" alt=ObrĂĄzek &egrave;Ă­slo/No. 153\" width=\"384\" height=\"297\">  </td>       </tr>     </table>  <h2>PĹĂ­slovĂ­</h2>        <p>Translate        these Czech proverbs and sayings and try to come up with an English        alternative.</p>      <table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\">       <tr>         <td width=\"60%\">  [$1, textarea 50,12]   </td>         <td width=\"40%\"><img src=\"/tuit/img/reading/prover3.gif\" width=\"305\" height=\"263>  </td>       </tr>     </table>   <p> ', 3, NULL),
(1490, 1, 'Opinion poll results', 'Reading U2', 1, '', '<h2>FiktivnĂ­ Noviny: Anketa</h2>  FiktivnĂ­  Noviny poloÂili tyto otĂĄzky obÄanĹŻm ÄeskĂŠ republiky. Zde jsou jejich odpovÄdi.<p>        <table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">          <tr>            <td width=\"474\" valign=\"top\">              <p> </p>            </td>            <td width=\"49\" valign=\"top\">              <p> </p>            </td>            <td width=\"48\" valign=\"top\">              <p><b>Ano              </b></p>            </td>            <td width=\"48\" valign=\"top\">              <p><b>Ne              </b></p>            </td>          </tr>          <tr>            <td width=\"474\" valign=\"top\">              <p>SouhlasĂ­te,              Âe ÄeskĂĄ vlĂĄda nenĂ­ schopnĂĄ?              </p>            </td>            <td width=\"49\" valign=\"top\">              <p> </p>            </td>            <td width=\"48\" valign=\"top\">              <p>60%</p>            </td>            <td width=\"48\" valign=\"top\">              <p>40%</p>            </td>          </tr>          <tr>            <td width=\"474\" valign=\"top\">              <p>VĂ­te,              kolik mĂĄ ÄeskĂĄ vlĂĄda ministrĹŻ?              </p>            </td>            <td width=\"49\" valign=\"top\">              <p> </p>            </td>            <td width=\"48\" valign=\"top\">              <p>20%</p>            </td>            <td width=\"48\" valign=\"top\">              <p>80%</p>            </td>          </tr>          <tr>            <td width=\"474\" valign=\"top\">              <p>VĂ­te,              jak se jmenuje ministr kultury a sportu?              </p>            </td>            <td width=\"49\" valign=\"top\">              <p> </p>            </td>            <td width=\"48\" valign=\"top\">              <p>35%              </p>            </td>            <td width=\"48\" valign=\"top\">              <p>75%              </p>            </td>          </tr>          <tr>            <td width=\"474\" valign=\"top\">              <p>SouhlasĂ­te,              Âe ÄeskĂŠ ÂkolstvĂ­ potĹebuje vĂ­c penÄz?              </p>            </td>            <td width=\"49\" valign=\"top\">              <p> </p>            </td>            <td width=\"48\" valign=\"top\">              <p>85%              </p>            </td>            <td width=\"48\" valign=\"top\">              <p>15%              </p>            </td>          </tr>          <tr>            <td width=\"474\" valign=\"top\">              <p>DomnĂ­vĂĄte              se, Âe ÄeskĂĄ republika mĂĄ mnoho prĂĄvnĂ­kĹŻ?              </p>            </td>            <td width=\"49\" valign=\"top\">              <p> </p>            </td>            <td width=\"48\" valign=\"top\">              <p>45%</p>            </td>            <td width=\"48\" valign=\"top\">              <p>55%</p>            </td>          </tr>          <tr>            <td width=\"474\" valign=\"top\">              <p>MyslĂ­te              si, Âe je v ÄeskĂŠ republice moc turistĹŻ?              </p>            </td>            <td width=\"49\" valign=\"top\">              <p> </p>            </td>            <td width=\"48\" valign=\"top\">              <p>35%</p>            </td>            <td width=\"48\" valign=\"top\">              <p>65%</p>            </td>          </tr>          <tr>            <td width=\"474\" valign=\"top\">              <p>SouhlasĂ­te,              Âe ÄeÂi jsou rasisti?              </p>            </td>            <td width=\"49\" valign=\"top\">              <p> </p>            </td>            <td width=\"48\" valign=\"top\">              <p>40%</p>            </td>            <td width=\"48\" valign=\"top\">              <p>60%</p>            </td>          </tr>          <tr>            <td width=\"474\" valign=\"top\">              <p>MyslĂ­te              si, Âe ÄeÂi chtÄjĂ­ mĂ­t komunistickou vlĂĄdu?              </p>            </td>            <td width=\"49\" valign=\"top\">              <p> </p>            </td>            <td width=\"48\" valign=\"top\">              <p>15%</p>            </td>            <td width=\"48\" valign=\"top\">              <p>85%</p>            </td>          </tr>        </table>        <p><b>Compare these opinions of the        Czechs with opinions of Britons and/or Americans.        </b></p>        <p>  [$1, textarea 60,2]          </p>        <p><b>Use the dictionary to discover        infinitives of all the verbs.        </b></p>        <p>  [$1, textarea 60,7]          </p>        <p><b>Write out all adverbs and        translate them.        </b>        <p>  [$1, textarea 60,7]  ', 3, NULL),
(1491, 1, 'Alphabet', 'Reading U2', 49, '', '<H2>Abeceda</H2>\r\n<P>Your task in the table below is to listen to how the sounds are pronounced and try to write an English equivalent to each of the Czech characters with a few English words as examples. You need RealPlayer Basic for this. Download it free from <A href=http://www.real.com/>http://www.real.com</A>.</P>\r\n<TABLE border=0 cellPadding=0 cellSpacing=0>\r\n<TBODY>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=43>\r\n<P><B><A href=/tuit/sound/grammar/czechsounds/a.rm>a</A> </B></P></TD>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=96>\r\n<P align=left LINES-TOGETHER><I><A href=/tuit/sound/grammar/alphabetname/a.rm>ĂĄ</A> </I></P></TD>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=156>\r\n<P align=left LINES-TOGETHER>[$1, text] </P></TD>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=48>\r\n<P><B><A href=/tuit/sound/grammar/czechsounds/o.rm>o</A> </B></P></TD>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=84>\r\n<P align=left LINES-TOGETHER><I><A href=/tuit/sound/grammar/alphabetname/o.rm>Ăł</A> </I></P></TD>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=156>\r\n<P align=left LINES-TOGETHER>[$1, text] </P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=43>\r\n<P><B><A href=/tuit/sound/grammar/czechsounds/a1.rm>ĂĄ</A> </B></P></TD>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=96>\r\n<P align=left LINES-TOGETHER><I><A href=/tuit/sound/grammar/alphabetname/dlouhea.rm>dlouhĂŠ ĂĄ</A> </I></P></TD>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=156>\r\n<P align=left LINES-TOGETHER>[$1, text] </P></TD>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=48>\r\n<P><B><A href=/tuit/sound/grammar/czechsounds/o1.rm>Ăł</A> </B></P></TD>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=84>\r\n<P align=left LINES-TOGETHER><I><A href=/tuit/sound/grammar/alphabetname/dlouheo.rm>dlouhĂŠ Ăł</A> </I></P></TD>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=156>\r\n<P align=left LINES-TOGETHER>[$1, text] </P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=43>\r\n<P><B><A href=/tuit/sound/grammar/czechsounds/b.rm>b</A> </B></P></TD>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=96>\r\n<P align=left LINES-TOGETHER><I><A href=/tuit/sound/grammar/alphabetname/be.rm>bĂŠ</A> </I></P></TD>\r\n<TD vAlign=top