(1492, 1, 'PenĂ­ze a potraviny (Survey of Prague, Brno and PlzeĹ food prices)', 'Reading U2', 1, '', '<h2>PenĂ­ze a potraviny</h2>        <p>Read this transcript of a radio        broadcast about food prices in the Czech Republic and complete the table        below:<br>        <i>(Remember, Czech fractions use a comma e.g. 13,50. Put an \'x\' in field        where you don\'t know the information.)</i></p>        <p>ÂV        Praze dnes stojĂ­ potraviny mĂŠnÄ neÂ tĹeba v BrnÄ nebo v Plzni.        NapĹĂ­klad mlĂŠko stojĂ­ v BrnÄ jedenĂĄct korun osmdesĂĄt, ale v Praze        jenom deset devadesĂĄt. Chleba stojĂ­ v Plzni patnĂĄct ÄtyĹicet, v BrnÄ        ÄtrnĂĄct osmdesĂĄt a v Praze nÄkde jen dvanĂĄct devadesĂĄt. RohlĂ­ky        stojĂ­ vÂude pĹibliÂnÄ stejnÄ, jednu korunu a deset halĂŠĹĹŻ.        Brambory stojĂ­ osm korun za kilogram v Praze, ale v BrnÄ tĹeba        i jedenĂĄct padesĂĄt. SĂ˝r stojĂ­ v BrnÄ ÄtrnĂĄct korun za deset        deka a v Praze jen tĹinĂĄct dvacet. KuĹecĂ­ salĂĄm stojĂ­ osm korun        za deset deka v Praze i v BrnÄ, ale v Plzni je za devÄt tĹicet.        Jenom alkohol stojĂ­ vĂ­c v Praze neÂ mimo Prahu. PĹŻl litr piva        stojĂ­ v praÂskĂŠ hospodÄ prĹŻmÄrnÄ sedmnĂĄct osmdesĂĄt, zatĂ­mco        v BrnÄ a v Plzni si mĹŻÂete koupit pivo i za tĹinĂĄct korun.Â        </p>        <table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">          <tr>            <td width=\"177\" valign=\"top\">              <p> </p>            </td>            <td width=\"154\" valign=\"top\">              <p> </p>            </td>            <td width=\"96\" valign=\"top\">              <p>Praha</p>            </td>            <td width=\"96\" valign=\"top\">              <p>Brno</p>            </td>            <td width=\"96\" valign=\"top\">              <p>PlzeĹ              </p>            </td>          </tr>          <tr>            <td width=\"177\" valign=\"top\">              <p>milk</p>            </td>            <td 