(1493, 1, 'Dialog v kancelĂĄĹi', 'Reading U2', 1, '', '        <h2>Dialog v kancelĂĄĹi</h2>        </div>        <p><img src=\"/tuit/img/reading/office1.gif\" width=\"708\" height=\"592></span></p>        <h3>Content questions</h3>        <p>Who        is Mr. Malina waiting for?<br>  [$1, text 60]         <p>Why is he waiting for the person?<br>  [$1, text 60]         <p>What does Mr. Malina want to drink?<br>  [$1, text 60]         <p>What sort of mineral water does he prefer?<br>  [$1, text 60]         <p>Why is Mr. Malina asking for pen and paper?<br>  [$1, text 60]  <p>        <h3>Language questions</h3>        <p>Find all        direct objects and explain what rule was applied.<br>  [$1, textarea 90,6] <p>  Translate all verbs and explain whether they are in the        infinitive or a finite form.<br>  [$1, textarea 90,10]  ', 3, NULL),
(1494, 1, 'JĂ­delnĂ­ lĂ­stek', 'Reading U2', 1, '', ' <table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">          <tr>            <td width=\"604\" valign=\"top\">              <p align=\"center\"><b>JĂ­delnĂ­ lĂ­stek</b></p>              <div>                <p><b>PolĂŠvky                </b></p>              </div>              <p>SlepiÄĂ­              nudlovĂĄ polĂŠvka..........................................................................................              27.40</p>              <p>HovÄzĂ­              vĂ˝var s jĂĄtrovĂ˝mi knedlĂ­Äky.........................................................................              21.20</p>              <p>BramborovĂĄ              polĂŠvka s Äerstvou zeleninou ......................................................... 29.90</p>              <p>SmetanovĂĄ              ÂampiĂłnovĂĄ polĂŠvka ......................................................................... 28.50</p>              <div>                <p><b>HotovĂĄ jĂ­dla                </b></p>              </div>              <p>KuĹe,              brambor, salĂĄt................................................................................................              82.00</p>              <p>VepĹovĂŠ              maso, zelĂ­, knedlĂ­k....................................................................................              98.00</p>              <p>RybĂ­              filĂŠ, hranolky, obloha.......................................................................................              74.00</p>              <p>HovÄzĂ­              gulĂĄÂ, rĂ˝Âe.................................................................................................... 89.00</p>              <div>                <p><b>BezmasĂĄ jĂ­dla                </b></p>              </div>              <p>SmaÂenĂ˝              sĂ˝r, tatarskĂĄ omĂĄÄka..............................................................................65.00</p>              <p>PalaÄinka   