(1495, 1, 'Vocative in Reading (Reading U1)', NULL, 49, '', '<h2>PĂ­seĹ</h2>         <p>Identify the Vocative and explain         its use. <a href=\"tuit/sound/reading/jednadvetristyrypet.rm\">Click here to listen         to the song.</a></p>         <table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\">           <tr>             <td width=\"50%\">  [$1, textarea 40,5]   </td>             <td width=\"50%\"><a href=\"tuit/sound/reading/jednadvetristyrypet.rm\"><img src=\"/tuit/img/reading/vocati4.gif\" border=\"0\" width=\"335\" height=\"147></a></span></td>           </tr>         </table>         <p align=\"right\">Â </p>           <h2>CitĂĄt          </h2>         <p>The         famous romantic poem <i>Â MĂĄj         </i>written at the beginning of the 19<sup>th</sup>         century by <i>Karel         Hynek MĂĄcha </i>ends with these words. What is         the position of the person saying these words? What are names of the         people as they would be displayed e.g. in church records.</p>         <table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\">           <tr>             <td width=\"50%\"><img src=\"/tuit/img/reading/vocati5.gif\" width=\"244\" height=\"146></span></td>             <td width=\"50%\">  [$1, textarea 42,5]   </td>           </tr>         </table> ', 3, ''),
(1496, 1, 'ZnĂĄt,vÄdÄt,umÄt', NULL, 49, '', '  [$1, select:umĂ­m/(znĂĄm/vĂ­m] Prahu.   [$1, select:umĂ­m/znĂĄm/(vĂ­m] , kde je NĂĄrodnĂ­ divadlo.   [$1, select:umĂ­m/(znĂĄm/vĂ­m] tu restauraci.   [$1, select:(umĂ­m)/znĂĄm/vĂ­m] trochu Äesky.   [$1, select:umĂ­m/znĂĄm/(vĂ­m)] , kdo je to.   [$1, select:(umĂ­m)/znĂĄm/vĂ­m] hrĂĄt golf.   [$1, select:umĂ­m/(znĂĄm)/vĂ­m] ÄeskĂ˝ film.   [$1, select:umĂ­m/(znĂĄm)/vĂ­m]  Davida.   [$1, select:umĂ­m/znĂĄm/(vĂ­m)] ,co mĂĄ Eva.   [$1, select:umĂ­m/znĂĄm/(vĂ­m)] ,Âe Jana mluvĂ­ anglicky. ', 3, ''),
(1497, 1, 'Adding v, ve, na', NULL, 49, '', 'Âel jsem   [$1, select:/v/ve/(na]  poÂtu. Byl jsem   [$1, select:/(v/ve/na]  galerii.   [$1, select:/(V/Ve/Na]  ĂşterĂ˝ jsem byl   [$1, select:/v/ve/(na]  diskotĂŠce. Bydlel jsem   [$1, select:/(v/ve/na]  Americe.   [$1, select:/V/Ve/(Na]  kĹiÂovatce zahnÄte doleva. HrĂĄli jsme fotbal   [$1, select:/(v/ve/na]  parku. DĂ­val jsem se   [$1, select:/v/ve/(na]  televizi. Studoval jsem   [$1, select:/v/ve/(na]  koleji. Jeli jsme   [$1, select:/v/ve/(na]  nĂĄdraÂĂ­. Jedli jsme  [$1, select:/(v/ve/na]  restauraci.   [$1, select:/V/(Ve/Na]  stĹedu jsem Äetl knihu. Byli jsme   [$1, select:/(v/ve/na]  kinÄ.   ', 3, ''),
(1498, 1, '<i>To be</i> and to <i>have</i> (Reading U1)', NULL, 49, '', ' <h2>Vtip</h2>     <p>Complete     the conjugation of the verb with all personal pronouns and infinitive. Why do     you think this was considered funny.</p>     <table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\">       <tr>         <td width=\"50%\">  [$1, textarea 40,13]   </td>         <td width=\"50%\"><img src=\"/tuit/img/reading/tobe_t6.gif\" alt=ObrĂĄzek cĂ­slo/No. 045\" width=\"334\" height=\"359\"></span></td>       </tr>     </table>     <h2>CitĂĄt</h2>   <p>Who said   this? Translate word for word and double-check with a dictionary. </p>         <table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\">           <tr>             <td width=\"42%\"><img src=\"/tuit/img/reading/tobe_t1.gif\" width=\"240\" height=\"144></span></td>             <td width=\"58%\">  [$1, textarea 40,7]   </td>           </tr>         </table>   <p> </p>     <h2>PĹĂ­slovĂ­    </h2>   <p>Use <a href=\"../../dictionary/dictionarytop.htm\">   dictionary</a> to discover one rule of the plural for nouns and adjectives.</p>         <table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\">           <tr>             <td width=\"50%\">  [$1, textarea 40,7]   </td>             <td width=\"50%\">               <p align=\"center\"><img src=\"/tuit/img/reading/tobe_t2.gif\" width=\"268\" height=\"167></span></td>           </tr>         </table>   <p align=\"left\"> </p>     <h2>PĂ­seĹ</h2>   <p>This is the chorus of a popular 80sÂ   rock song. What is its message?</p>         <table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\">           <tr>             <td width=\"36%\"><img src=\"/tuit/img/reading/tobe_t3.gif\" width=\"202\" height=\"147></span></td>             <td width=\"64%\">  [$1, textarea 44,7]   </td>           </tr>         </table> ', 3, ''),
(1499, 1, 'Spelling (Reading U1)', NULL, 49, '', ' <h3>Try some English words in Czech spelling</h3>       <p>Pronounce       the words in English, and then try to think what it would sound like to a       Czech.       <table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"5\" cellpadding=\"0\">         <tr>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             feet           </td>           <td width=\"20%\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             leisure           </td>           <td width=\"134\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             law           </td>           <td width=\"134\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>         </tr>         <tr>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             hair           </td>           <td width=\"132\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             ship           </td>           <td width=\"134\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             spa           </td>           <td width=\"134\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>         </tr>         <tr>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             duty           </td>           <td width=\"132\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             cheap           </td>           <td width=\"134\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             sports           </td>           <td width=\"134\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>         </tr>         <tr>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             stow           </td>           <td width=\"132\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>           <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\">             you           </td>           <td width=\"134\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text]           </td>