(1823, 1, 'Complete misc prepositions 2 (Prepositions)', NULL, 49, '', '<h3>DoplĹte!</h3>  <p>Kde jste byla  [$1, text 2:v]  pondÄlĂ­ veÄer?  [$1, text 2:Na]  koncertÄ. &nbsp;Jdu  [$1, text 2:do]  prĂĄce.   [$1, text 2:Po]  obÄdÄ jsme Âli domĹŻ. &nbsp;Edita BrownovĂĄ je ______ Anglie. &nbsp;DĂ­vĂĄm  se  [$1, text 2:na]  televizi. &nbsp;Odpoledne pĹŻjdu  [$1, text 2:na]  nĂĄkup. &nbsp;Jdu  [$1, text 2:do]  divadla. &nbsp;Jdu  [$1, text 2:na]  nĂĄvÂtÄvu  [$1, text 2:k]  Petrovi. &nbsp;V pĂĄtek jedeme   [$1, text 2:do]  Prahy. &nbsp;Byli jsme  [$1, text 2:v]  BrnÄ. &nbsp;Äteme knihu  [$1, text 2:o]  JihlavÄ.  &nbsp;ÄekĂĄm  [$1, text 2:na]  kamarĂĄdku. &nbsp;Âli jsme  [$1, text 2:na]  vĂ˝stavu a potom  [$1, text 2:do]  kina. &nbsp;Äekali jsme  [$1, text 2:u]  kina skoro hodinu. &nbsp;PĹŻjdu  [$1, text 2:na]  nĂĄmÄstĂ­   [$1, text 2:do]  banky a  [$1, text 2:na]  poÂtu.</p>   ', 3, ''),
