(1880, 1, 'Correct telegram (Spelling)', NULL, 49, '', '<h3>DoplĹte hĂĄÄky a ÄĂĄrky!</h3>  <table cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"2\" border=\"2\" bordercolor=\"#000000\" width=\"621\" height=\"520\">    <tbody>      <tr>        <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"632\" colSpan=\"5\" height=\"63\">          <p><b><big>Telegram</big></b></p>          <p><b>PiÂte ÄitelnÄ Â adresu hĹŻlkovĂ˝m pĂ­smem!          &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;          </b><sub>SilnÄ orĂĄmovanĂŠ ÄĂĄsti vyplnĂ­ odesĂ­latel!</sub></p>        </td>      </tr>      <tr height=\"38\">        <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"201\" height=\"120\" colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"2\">          <p></p>        </td>        <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"218\" height=\"76\">          <p><b>Adresa odesĂ­latele<br>          <br>          </b>Jim Brown<br>          nam. B. Smetany 15<br>          Jihlava</p>        </td>        <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"194\" height=\"82\"> [$1, textarea 20,4] </td>        <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"1\" height=\"120\" rowspan=\"2\"></td>      </tr>      <tr height=\"38\">        <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"218\" height=\"32\">          <p>&nbsp;</p>        </td>        <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"194\" height=\"32\"></td>      </tr>      <tr height=\"19\">        <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"650\" height=\"19\" colspan=\"4\"></td>      </tr>      <tr height=\"38\">        <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"632\" height=\"32\" colspan=\"5\"></td>      </tr>      <tr height=\"76\">        <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"60\" height=\"95\" style=\"border-style: solid\">          <p><b>PlacenĂŠ Ăşdaje</b></p>        </td>        <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"566\" colSpan=\"4\" height=\"95\" style=\"border-style: solid\">          <p align=\"left\"><b>Adresa pĹĂ­jemce (jmĂŠno nebo oznaÄenĂ­ Â ulice          Â ÄĂ­slo domu Â mĂ­sto urÄenĂ­ mĂĄ-li adresĂĄt telefon, uveÄte          jeho ÄĂ­slo pĹed adresou!)</b></p>       