could, I would.</span></font></i></p>\r\n        </td>\r\n        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; BACKGROUND: #f1f1f1; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; WIDTH: 87.85pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid\" vAlign=\"top\" width=\"117\" bgColor=\"white\">\r\n          <p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 3pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\">Â </p>\r\n        </td>\r\n        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; BACKGROUND: #f1f1f1; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; WIDTH: 87.85pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid\" vAlign=\"top\" width=\"117\">\r\n          <p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 3pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\">Â </p>\r\n        </td>\r\n      </tr>\r\n      <tr>\r\n        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; BACKGROUND: #e6e6e6; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; WIDTH: 93.4pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid\" vAlign=\"top\" width=\"125\" bgColor=\"#e6e6e6\">\r\n          <p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 3pt\"><b><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">Superlatives/\r\n          Comparatives</span></font></b></p>\r\n        </td>\r\n        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; BACKGROUND: #f1f1f1; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; WIDTH: 87.85pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid\" vAlign=\"top\" width=\"117\">\r\n          <p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 3pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\">Â </p>\r\n        </td>\r\n        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; WIDTH: 87.85pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid\" vAlign=\"top\" width=\"117\">\r\n          <p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 3pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\"><font size=\"1\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">bigger,\r\n          biggest</span></font></p>\r\n        </td>\r\n        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; BACKGROUND: #f1f1f1; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; WIDTH: 87.85pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid\" vAlign=\"top\" width=\"117\">\r\n          <p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 3pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\">Â </p>\r\n        </td>\r\n        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; BACKGROUND: #f1f1f1; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; WIDTH: 87.85pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid\" vAlign=\"top\" width=\"117\">\r\n          <p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 3pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\">Â </p>\r\n        </td>\r\n        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; BACKGROUND: #f1f1f1; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; WIDTH: 87.85pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid\" vAlign=\"top\" width=\"117\">\r\n          <p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 3pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\">Â </p>\r\n        </td>\r\n        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; WIDTH: 87.85pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid\" vAlign=\"top\" width=\"117\">\r\n          <p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 3pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\"><font size=\"1\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">more\r\n          slowly,<br>\r\n          most slowly</span></font></p>\r\n        </td>\r\n        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.5pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; BACKGROUND: #f1f1f1; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; WIDTH: 87.85pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid\" vAlign=\"top\" width=\"117\">\r\n          <p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 3pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\">Â </p>\r\n        </td>\r\n      </tr>\r\n    </tbody>\r\n  </table>\r\n  <p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0cm\"><span><sup><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">*</span></font></sup></span>\r\n  Outside this system lie Conjunctions (and, if, or), Interjections (ouch!) and\r\n  Particles (thus) which never change their form or influence other words to\r\n  change form. <b><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">Note: </span></b>Some pronouns\r\n  function as conjunctions (who, which, whose Â so called relative pronouns)\r\n  and of course change their form with all the categories relevant to pronouns.</p>\r\n  <p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0cm\"><span><sup><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">**\r\n  </span></font></sup></span>Masculine nouns and adjectives can be either\r\n  animate or inanimate thus in effect multiplying the number of genders to four.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n', 1, NULL);
 / He never comes.<o:p></o:p></P></TD></TR></TBODY></TABLE></DIV>', 3, NULL),
(1940, 1, 'Facts about Czech Republic', 'Reading U3', 49, '', '<h2>Fakta o ÄeskĂŠ republice</h2>       <p><b>Translate       these facts about the Czech Republic into digits.</b></p>       <p>ÄeskĂĄ       republika mĂĄ deset miliĂłnĹŻ obyvatel. NejvĂ­ce ÄechĹŻ Âije v Praze,       kterĂĄ mĂĄ tĂŠmÄĹ miliĂłn a pĹŻl obyvatel. DalÂĂ­ velkĂĄ mÄsta jsou       Brno s tĹi sta osmdesĂĄti tisĂ­ci lidĂ­ a PlzeĹ, kde Âije pĹes       sto sedmdesĂĄt tisĂ­c obyvatel. ÄeskĂĄ republika sousedĂ­ se ÄtyĹmi       dalÂĂ­mi zemÄmi, NÄmeckem, Polskem, Slovenskem a Rakouskem. Rozloha ÄeskĂŠ       republiky je pĹibliÂnÄ sedmdesĂĄt osm tisĂ­c osm set ÂedesĂĄt ÄtyĹi       kilometrĹŻ ÄtvereÄnĂ­ch. V ÄeskĂŠ republice je ÄtyĹicet ÄtyĹi       procent ateistĹŻ, ÄtyĹicet procent katolĂ­kĹŻ, pÄt procent protestantĹŻ       a ÂestnĂĄct procent ostatnĂ­ch nĂĄboÂenstvĂ­. HrubĂ˝ domĂĄcĂ­ produkt (HDP)       v roce devatenĂĄct set devadesĂĄt devÄt byl dvacet sedm a pĹŻl       miliardy dolarĹŻ. PrĹŻmÄrnĂ˝ plat v ÄechĂĄch je tĹinĂĄct tisĂ­c ÄtyĹi       sta padesĂĄt korun mÄsĂ­ÄnÄ. PrĹŻmÄrnĂ˝ kurz dolaru v roce       devatenĂĄct set devadesĂĄt osm byl tĹicet ÄtyĹi koruny padesĂĄt halĂŠĹĹŻ.</p>       <p>               </p>       <table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\">         <tr>           <td width=\"25%\" valign=\"top\">             <p align=\"left\"><b>Czech Republic Population:                          </b></p>           </td>           <td width=\"25%\" valign=\"top\">             <p> </p>           </td>           <td width=\"25%\" valign=\"top\">             <p> </p>           </td>           <td width=\"25%\" valign=\"top\">             <p> </p>           </td>         </tr>         <tr>           <td width=\"25%\" valign=\"top\">             <p align=\"left\"><b>Three largest cities and their population:                          </b></p>           </td>           <td width=\"25%\" valign=\"top\">             <p>1.  [$1