(2354, 1, 'UEA Sample', '', 56, 'Complete the given tasks and answer questions', '<p>Since the [$1, select:/beginning/(end] of communism in 1989, the Czech Republic has become central Europe\'s number [$1, text:one] tourist destination. </p>\r\n<p>But last year\'[$2, text:s] numbers far exceeded the previous high of 5.6 million in [\"1999:This was before the floods.].</p>\r\n<p>Officials at Czech Tourism said 2004 had been a bumper year because of the proliferation of low budget airlines, particularly flying between Britain and the [$1, text:Czech] Republic.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong><font color=\"#800000\"><font size=\"4\">Questions:</font>\r\n<br />\r\n</font>\r\nWhat is a bumper year?<br />\r\n</strong>\r\n[$0$1, checkbox] [^good:dobrĂ˝] year<br />\r\n[$1$0, checkbox] bad year<br />\r\n[$0$1, checkbox] plentiful year<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>When was the last time the tourist trade was as high as 2004?</strong>\r\n<br />\r\n[$0, radio:1] 1989<br />\r\n[$3, radio:1] 1999<br />\r\n[$0, radio:1] 2003<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>What is your experience of the Czech tourism industry?<br />\r\n[$20, textarea 60,6]<br />\r\n</strong>\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Test yourself<br />\r\n</strong>\r\nÄeskĂĄ republika [{Czech Republic]<br />\r\nbohatĂ˝ rok [{bumper year]<br />\r\n<br />\r\n</p>\r\n', 1, NULL),
(2355, 1, 'Hokus Pokus s HTMLArea', 'blabla', 1, 'Complete with', 'One of the sites I link to for free <a href=\"http://www.saxongifts.com/\">http://www.Saxongifts.com</a> has <strong>generously</strong> offered a donation of $25 to help run the website. Since any commercial application of the web seems to be far away and the costs are not getting any lower, I decided to create a <a href=\"/?m=catalog&s=271\">Sponsors</a> section. To appear on it donate $5 or more <a href=\"/?m=catalog&s=271\">here</a>. (Novermber 27, 2003) ', 1, NULL),
(2356, 1, 'Sample exercise', '', 49, 'Fill in', '\r\nA Canadian [$3, /(conservationist)/tree hugger/environmentalist] with the World Wildlife Fund is among 24 people reported missing in a remote mountainou<nobr>[$1, text:s] area of eastern Nepal.<br /><br />Canadian Jennifer Headley, the U.K.-based coordinator for the WWF\'s Eastern Himalayas operations, and the other passengers were [^velkĂ˝] travelling in a helicopter in a mountainous area covered with thick forests when it went missing early Saturday. [{this is a hint]<br /><br /><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Summarize text:<br /></span>[$1, text 10, 20]<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br /></span></nobr>', 1, NULL),
