(912, 13, 'Carol', 'cdamioli@praguepost.com', 'Re: Important Czech words', 'You say you had two months to learn the language Â did you succeed? If so, how, exactly? And what is the advantage of listening to Czech-language radio stations over the Internet, as opposed to just turning on the radio?', '2003-04-03 23:05:47', 908, 1),
