(1257, 13, 'Tarla', 'nuriel@poczta.fm', 'is there any good soul who could teach me some czech?', 'or at least show me any good czech-teaching site? I would join the mailing list, but I have no proper access to the internet when I\'m in the city where I study, and therefore can\'t let my mailbox get clogged.. \r\nI don\'t know any czech, I\'m afraid.. my native lg is polish, and I speak a little bit of spanish and french,too.. should I mention english?;)\r\nI\'d be very grateful if anyone could help me..\r\n', '2003-12-31 23:12:30', 0, 1),
(1258, 13, 'Jakub', 'jakubv@email.cz', 'Re: help - translation', 'I\'m glad to help you, Don.\r\n\r\nIf I can help you with Czech, also don\'t hesitate to e-mail.\r\n\r\nPF 2004\r\nJakub', '2004-01-02 22:23:26', 1252, 0),
