(1488, 1, 'Recipes', 'Reading U2', 1, '', '<h1>Recept</h1>        <h3>HovÄzĂ­ polĂŠvka: recept na pĹĂ­pravu</h3>        <p>NĂĄÂ        produkt je ideĂĄlnĂ­ pro rychlou a snadnou pĹĂ­pravu lahodnĂŠ polĂŠvky! K svaÄinÄ        nebo k obÄdu. Doma, v prĂĄci nebo na chatÄ.        </p>        <p>KdyÂ mĂĄte        hlad a nemĂĄte Äas. KdyÂ potĹebujete rychle nÄco k jĂ­dlu.        InstantnĂ­ hovÄzĂ­ polĂŠvku pĹipravĂ­te za tĹi minuty. PotĹebujete na        to jenom termosku horkĂŠ vody a je to. InstantnĂ­ polĂŠvku dĂĄte do ÂĂĄlku        a pĹidĂĄte 0,2 litru horkĂŠ vody. Za tĹi minuty je polĂŠvka hotovĂĄ.        </p>        <p><b>Translate        the text:        </b></p>        <p> [$1, textarea 60,4]          </p>        <p><b>Locate        all words in accusative in the above text, give the nominative form and        explain why accusative was used        </b></p>        <p>e.g. <u>na        pĹĂ­pravu</u> Â pĹĂ­prava Â accusative required by preposition <i>na</i></p>        <p> [$1, textarea 60,4]          </p>        <p> </p>        <p> <img src=\"/tuit/img/reading/recipe1.gif\" alt=\"Text Box: %KOHO?CO?	chtĂ­t	chci,chceÂ,chce, chceme, chcete, chtÄjĂ­  	mĂ­t	mĂĄm, mĂĄÂ, mĂĄ, mĂĄme, mĂĄte, majĂ­  	dĂĄt si	dĂĄm, ÂINSERT INTO `exercises` (`ex_id`, `ex_type`, `ex_name`, `ex_description`, `ex_creator`, `ex_task`, `ex_story`, `ex_difficulty`, `ex_options`) VALUES
(1500, 1, 'Newspaper Headlines (Reading U1)', NULL, 49, '', ' <img border=\"0\" src=\"/tuit/img/exercises/LNlogo.gif\" width=\"222\" height=\"46\">          <table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\">            <tr>              <td width=\"50%\">          <p align=\"left\"><b>SexuĂĄlnĂ­          revoluce v ÄeskĂŠ televizi.<br></b>          <img width=\"118\" height=\"15\" src=\"newspapercolumn.gif\"> <img width=\"118\" height=\"15\" src=\"newspapercolumn.gif\"></p>          <p><b>KulturnĂ­ Âok ÄeskĂŠho turisty v Americe<br></b>          <img width=\"118\" height=\"15\" src=\"newspapercolumn.gif\"> <img width=\"118\" height=\"15\" src=\"newspapercolumn.gif\"></p>          <p align=\"left\"><b>Trable ÄeskĂŠ modelky Terezy MaxovĂŠ <br></b>          <img width=\"118\" height=\"15\" src=\"newspapercolumn.gif\"> <img width=\"118\" height=\"15\" src=\"newspapercolumn.gif\"></p>          <p><b>ProblĂŠmy ÄeskĂŠ televize <br></b>          <img width=\"118\" height=\"15\" src=\"newspapercolumn.gif\"> <img width=\"118\" height=\"15\" src=\"newspapercolumn.gif\"></p>          <p><b>TragĂŠdie v americkĂŠm hotelu <br></b>          <img width=\"118\" height=\"15\" src=\"newspapercolumn.gif\"> <img width=\"118\" height=\"15\" src=\"newspapercolumn.gif\"></p>          <p><b>Katastrofy ÄeskĂŠ ekonomiky <br></b>          <img width=\"118\" height=\"15\" src=\"newspapercolumn.gif\"> <img width=\"118\" height=\"15\" src=\"newspapercolumn.gif\"></p>          <p><b>DestinovĂĄ: prvnĂ­ dĂĄma ÄeskĂŠ opery<br></b>          <img width=\"118\" height=\"15\" src=\"newspapercolumn.gif\"> <img width=\"118\" height=\"15\" src=\"newspapercolumn.gif\"></p>          <p><b>Krize anglickĂ˝ch Âkol<br></b>          <img width=\"118\" height=\"15\" src=\"newspapercolumn.gif\"> <img width=\"118\" height=\"15\" src=\"newspapercolumn.gif\"></p>          <p><b>GeniĂĄlnĂ­ anekdota v televiznĂ­m seriĂĄlu         <br></b>          <img width=\"118\" height=\"15\" src=\"newspapercolumn.gif\"> <img width=\"118\" height=\"15\" src=\"newspapercolumn.gif\"></p>                <p> </td>              <td width=\"50%\" bgcolor=\"#FEC254\">          <p>Translate all headlines without          the use of a dictionary.<br>   [$1, textarea 40,2]     </p>          <p>What can you discover about the          word ÂcatastropheÂ?<br>   [$1, textarea 40,2]     </p>          <p>How do you say Âa legendÂ in          Czech?<br>   [$1, textarea 40,2]     </p>          <p>What two functions can you          identify for the ending <i>Ây</i>?<br>   [$1, textarea 40,2]     </p>          <p>How do you say ÂjokesÂ in          Czech?<br>   [$1, textarea 40,2]     </p>              </td>            </tr>            <tr>              <td width=\"50%\" bgcolor=\"#FEC254\">          <p>What are some differences between          the use of capital letters in Czech and English?<br>   [$1, textarea 40,2]     </p>          <p>Find places where English would          use the preposition ÂofÂ and Czech makes do with an ending. What is          the ending?<br>   [$1, textarea 40,2]     </p>          <p>How does Czech express          plural?   [$1, textarea 40,2]     </p>          <p>How do you say Âthey haveÂ?<br>   [$1, textarea 40,2]                 <p><img border=\"0\" src=\"/tuit/img/exercises/lnrollup.gif\" width=\"93\" height=\"49\"></td>              <td width=\"50%\">          <p align=\"right\"><b>ZfalÂovanĂŠ          kreditnĂ­ karty v MoskvÄ<br></b>          <img width=\"118\" height=\"15\" src=\"newspapercolumn.gif\"> <img width=\"118\" height=\"15\" src=\"newspapercolumn.gif\">          </span></p>          <p align=\"left\"><b>Legendy          ÄeskĂŠho filmu<br></b>          <img width=\"118\" height=\"15\" src=\"newspapercolumn.gif\"> <img width=\"118\" height=\"15\" src=\"newspapercolumn.gif\">          </span></p>          <p align=\"right\"><b>HumanitĂĄrnĂ­          katastrofa v ÄeÄenskĂŠm hlavnĂ­m mÄstÄ Groznyj<br></b>          <img width=\"118\" height=\"15\" src=\"newspapercolumn.gif\"> <img width=\"118\" height=\"15\" src=\"newspapercolumn.gif\">          </span></p>          <p align=\"left\"><b>Monarchie          nebo republika: dilema pro novou AustrĂĄlii<br></b>          <img width=\"118\" height=\"15\" src=\"newspapercolumn.gif\"> <img width=\"118\" height=\"15\" src=\"newspapercolumn.gif\">          </span></p>          <p align=\"right\"><b>Nobelova          cena mĂ­ru maÄarskĂŠmu politikovi<br></b>          <img width=\"118\" height=\"15\" src=\"newspapercolumn.gif\"> <img width=\"118\" height=\"15\" src=\"newspapercolumn.gif\">          </span></p>          <p align=\"left\"><b>Ceny          benzĂ­nu v Evrope pĹŻsobĂ­ problĂŠmy automobilistĹŻm<br></b>          <img width=\"118\" height=\"15\" src=\"newspapercolumn.gif\"> <img width=\"118\" height=\"15\" src=\"newspapercolumn.gif\">          </span></p>          <p align=\"right\"><b>John          Lennon sponzoroval irskĂŠ teroristy<br></b>          <img width=\"118\" height=\"15\" src=\"newspapercolumn.gif\"> <img src=\"/tuit/img/reading/newspapercolumn.gif\" width=\"118\" height=\"15>          </span></p>          <p align=\"left\"><b>AfgĂĄnÂtĂ­          extremistĂŠ majĂ­ problĂŠmy<br>          s feminismem<br></b>          <img width=\"118\" height=\"15\" src=\"newspapercolumn.gif\"> <img width=\"118\" height=\"15\" src=\"newspapercolumn.gif\">          </span></p>          <p align=\"right\"><b>BerlĂ­n:          SociĂĄlnĂ­ demokratĂŠ v NÄmecku<br>          riskujĂ­ novou afĂŠru sponzoringu<br></b>          <img width=\"118\" height=\"15\" src=\"newspapercolumn.gif\"> <img width=\"118\" height=\"15\" src=\"newspapercolumn.gif\"></span><img border=\"0\" src=\"/tuit/img/exercises/mfrollup.gif\" width=\"128\" height=\"40\"></p>              </td>            </tr>          </table>  ', 3, ''),
