(1506, 1, 'Lives of Three Czech Commedians (Reading U4)', NULL, 49, '', '        <h2>TĹi          velcĂ­ komici ÄeskĂŠho filmu          </h2>          <p>&nbsp;          <img src=\"/tuit/img/reading/lives_6.jpg\" align=\"left\" hspace=\"12\" width=\"204\" height=\"120>JmenujĂ­ se LubomĂ­r LipskĂ˝ (nalevo), Miroslav HornĂ­Äek (uprostĹed) a JiĹĂ­          SovĂĄk (napravo). Jsou to tĹi slavnĂ­ herci a komici, kteĹĂ­ bavili ÄeskĂŠ          televiznĂ­ i filmovĂŠ divĂĄky vĂ­ce neÂ ÄtyĹicet let. Jejich kariĂŠry          zaÄaly po druhĂŠ svÄtovĂŠ vĂĄlce kolem roku devatenĂĄct set padesĂĄt.          </p>          <p><b>LubomĂ­r          LipskĂ˝</b> se          narodil v&nbsp;roce devatenĂĄct set dvacet tĹi v&nbsp;PelhĹimovÄ. Do          Prahy pĹiÂel v&nbsp;roce devatenĂĄct set ÄtyĹicet pÄt a pozdÄji          zaloÂil populĂĄrnĂ­ praÂskĂŠ Divadlo satiry. Stal se znĂĄmĂ˝m hlavnÄ          pro svĂŠ komediĂĄlnĂ­ role v&nbsp;divadle i v&nbsp;televizi, napĹĂ­klad          role poruÄĂ­ka BorĹŻvky v&nbsp;detektivnĂ­ch inscenacĂ­ch Josefa ÂkvoreckĂŠho.          Mezi jeho nejznĂĄmÄjÂĂ­ filmy patĹĂ­ <i>MuÂ z&nbsp;prvnĂ­ho stoletĂ­          </i>a <i>Âest medvÄdĹŻ s&nbsp;Cibulkou</i>, kterĂŠ reÂĂ­roval jeho          bratr OldĹich.          </p>          <p><b>Miroslav          HornĂ­Äek </b>zaÄal          svou hereckou kariĂŠru v&nbsp;Plzni, kde se roku devatenĂĄct set osmnĂĄct          narodil. Âest let hrĂĄl v&nbsp;NĂĄrodnĂ­m divadle, a mezi&nbsp;lety          devatenĂĄct set padesĂĄt pÄt a ÂedesĂĄt jedna spolupracoval s&nbsp;legendĂĄrnĂ­m          Janem Werichem v&nbsp;divadle ABC. Od tĂŠ doby pĹŻsobil v&nbsp;divadle,          v&nbsp;televizi i ve filmu. V&nbsp;ÂedesĂĄtĂ˝ch letech byla velice          populĂĄrnĂ­ jeho televiznĂ­ Âou <i>Hovory H</i>, ale i seriĂĄl <i>Byli          jednou dva pĂ­saĹi</i>, ve kterĂŠm hrĂĄl s&nbsp;JiĹĂ­m SovĂĄkem. Jeho          role ve filmu se staly zĂĄkladem zlatĂŠho vÄku ÄeskĂŠ filmografie.          </p>          <p><b>JiĹĂ­          SovĂĄk</b>, narozen          devatenĂĄct set dvacet v&nbsp;Praze, zaÄal hrĂĄt&nbsp;          v&nbsp;divadle E. F. Buriana a svou kariĂŠru skonÄil po tĂŠmÄĹ          tĹiceti letech v&nbsp;NĂĄrodnĂ­m divadle. NejvÄtÂĂ­ ĂşspÄch ovÂem          znamenaly jeho role ve filmu a v&nbsp;televizi. Jeho filmy <i>Kam Äert          nemĹŻÂe</i>,<i> CoÂ takhle dĂĄt si ÂpenĂĄt</i> a <i>MareÄku, podejte          mi pero</i> si zĂ­skaly lĂĄsku ÄeskĂ˝ch divĂĄkĹŻ a jeho role v&nbsp;seriĂĄlech          jako <i>Byl jednou jeden dĹŻm </i>nebo <i>Arabela </i>pomohly ÄeskĂŠ          televizi vytvoĹit jasnĂ˝ profil. V&nbsp;devadesĂĄtĂ˝ch letech napsal          pamÄti, kterĂŠ se staly bestsellerem.          </p>        <h3>Tasks</h3>        <p>Identify sentences where the        subject follows the verb and translate them.</p>          <p> [$1, textarea 110,6] </p>        <p>List the different ways of        introducing years.</p>        <p> [$1, textarea 110,3]          </p>        <p>List different ways of describing        consecutive events.</p>        <p> [$1, textarea 110,6]          </p>        <p>List infinitives of all verbs and        translate them.</p>        <p> [$1, textarea 110,6]   ', 3, ''),
(1507, 1, 'If you want something you must - modal verbs and infinitives (Reading U4)', NULL, 49, '', '        <h2>Modal verbs and infinitive</h2>       <table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\">         <tr>           <td width=\"255\" valign=\"top\">             <p><b><i>Kdo chce, musĂ­!</i></b><img src=\"/tuit/img/reading/modal_3.gif\" width=\"242\" height=\"180>                          </p>           </td>           <td valign=\"top\">             <p>AleÂ             chce bĂ˝t doktor a proto musĂ­ hodnÄ studovat. KaÂdĂ˝ den v 7:30&nbsp;             musĂ­ jĂ­t do Âkoly a uÄit se biologii a chemii. Obvykle             musĂ­ odpoledne studovat a pĹipravovat se do Âkoly. ObÄas jde hrĂĄt             fotbal nebo tenis, ale potom musĂ­ studovat veÄer. Dnes musĂ­ mĂ­t             Ăşkoly hotovĂŠ v devatenĂĄct hodin, protoÂe chce jĂ­t na koncert ÄeskĂŠ             filharmonie do Rudolfina.</p>             <p>O vĂ­kendu             nemusĂ­ jĂ­t do Âkoly a proto chce jet na vĂ˝let na Moravu. Taky             musĂ­ koupit nÄco hezkĂŠho pro svou kamarĂĄdku.</p>           </td>         </tr>       </table>       <h4>Answer questions</h4>       <table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\">         <tr>           <td width=\"37%\" valign=\"top\">             <p><i>ProÄ             musĂ­ AleÂ hodnÄ studovat?                          </i></p>           </td>           <td width=\"63%\" valign=\"top\">             <p>&nbsp; [$1, text 60] </p>           </td>         </tr>         <tr>           <td width=\"37%\" valign=\"top\">             <p><i>V             kolik hodin musĂ­ jĂ­t do Âkoly?                          </i></p>           </td>           <td width=\"63%\" valign=\"top\">             <p>&nbsp; [$1, text 60] </p>           </td>         </tr>         <tr>           <td width=\"37%\" valign=\"top\">             <p><i>Co             se musĂ­ uÄit?                          </i></p>           </td>           <td width=\"63%\" valign=\"top\">             <p>&nbsp; [$1, text 60] </p>           </td>         </tr>         <tr>           <td width=\"37%\" valign=\"top\">             <p><i>Co             dÄlĂĄ odpoledne?                          </i></p>           </td>           <td width=\"63%\" valign=\"top\">             <p>&nbsp; [$1, text 60] </p>           </td>         </tr>       </table>       <h4>Create questions</h4>       <table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\">         <tr>           <td width=\"65%\" valign=\"top\">             <p>&nbsp; [$1, text 60] </p>           </td>           <td width=\"35%\" valign=\"top\">             <p><i>ProtoÂe&nbsp;             chce jĂ­t na koncert.                          </i></p>           </td>         </tr>         <tr>           <td width=\"65%\" valign=\"top\">             <p>&nbsp; [$1, text 60] </p>           </td>           <td width=\"35%\" valign=\"top\">             <p><i>Do Rudolfina.                          </i></p>           </td>         </tr>         <tr>           <td width=\"65%\" valign=\"top\">             <p>&nbsp; [$1, text 60] </p>           </td>           <td width=\"35%\" valign=\"top\">             <p><i>Jet             na vĂ˝let.                          </i></p>           </td>         </tr>         <tr>           <td width=\"65%\" valign=\"top\">             <p>&nbsp; [$1, text 60] </p>           </td>           <td width=\"35%\" valign=\"top\">             <p><i>Pro             svou kamarĂĄdku.                          </i></p>           </td>         </tr>       </table>       <h4>Create grammar rules for using the infinitives</h4>       <p> [$1, textarea 90,8]  ', 3, ''),
(1508, 1, 'Past Tense - Jim and Anna\'s Miscommunication (Reading U4)', NULL, 49, '', '<h2>JakĂ˝ mÄla Anna den?</h2>             <p><img src=\"/tuit/img/reading/past_t4.gif\" width=\"111\" height=\"110\" align=\"left>VÄera jsem mÄla ÂpatnĂ˝             den.MÄla jsem schĹŻzku s&nbsp;Jimem na nĂĄdraÂĂ­. ChtÄli jsme jet             na vĂ˝let. Ale Jim si myslel, Âe mĂĄme schĹŻzku na nĂĄdraÂĂ­ HoleÂovice             a jĂĄ jsem myslela, Âe je na HlavnĂ­m nĂĄdraÂĂ­.                          </p>       <p>StĂĄla             jsem na hlavnĂ­m nĂĄdraÂĂ­ dvacet minut a Jim nepĹiÂel. BĂĄla             jsem se, Âe zapomnÄl. <img src=\"/tuit/img/reading/past_t5.gif\" width=\"115\" height=\"112\" align=\"right> MÄla jsem hlad a chtÄla jsem pĂ­t. Tak jsem Âla do restaurace. Äetla jsem jĂ­delnĂ­ lĂ­stek             a pak jsem si dala kuĹe a brambory. Byla jsem v&nbsp;restauraci,             jedla kuĹe, pila kolu a myslela na Jima. Potom jsem chvĂ­li             studovala ÄeÂtinu a psala dopis kamarĂĄdce.V rĂĄdiu hrĂĄli Beatles             a tak jsem mÄla dobrou nĂĄladu.                          </p>       <p>Za hodinu a pĹŻl pĹiÂel Jim. OtevĹel dveĹe a moc             se smĂĄl. Ĺekl: Â Anno, jĂĄ jsem zapomnÄl, kde jsme&nbsp; mÄli schĹŻzku.Â JĂĄ jsem se smĂĄla taky a Ĺekla jsem :             ÂTo jsi celĂ˝ ty!Â                          </p>       <h4>Answer in English</h4>       <table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\">         <tr>           <td width=\"231\" valign=\"bottom\">             <p>JakĂ˝ mÄla Anna den?</p>           </td>           <td width=\"383\" valign=\"bottom\">             <p>&nbsp; [$1, text 60] </p>           </td>         </tr>         <tr>           <td width=\"231\" valign=\"bottom\">             <p>Kde             mÄli schĹŻzku?</p>           </td>           <td width=\"383\" valign=\"bottom\">             <p>&nbsp; [$1, text 60] </p>           </td>         </tr>         <tr>           <td width=\"231\" valign=\"bottom\">             <p>Kam chtÄli jet?</p>           </td>           <td width=\"383\" valign=\"bottom\">             <p>&nbsp; [$1, text 60] </p>           </td>         </tr>         <tr>           <td width=\"231\" valign=\"bottom\">             <p>Kde stĂĄla Anna?</p>           </td>           <td width=\"383\" valign=\"bottom\">             <p>&nbsp; [$1, text 60] </p>           </td>         </tr>         <tr>           <td width=\"231\" valign=\"bottom\">             <p>Kde Äekal Jim?</p>           </td>           <td width=\"383\" valign=\"bottom\">             <p>&nbsp; [$1, text 60] </p>           </td>         </tr>         <tr>           <td width=\"231\" valign=\"bottom\">             <p>ProÄ Âla Anna do restaurace?</p>           </td>           <td width=\"383\" valign=\"bottom\">             <p>&nbsp; [$1, text 60] </p>           </td>         </tr>         <tr>           <td width=\"231\" valign=\"bottom\">             <p>Co Äetla v restauraci?</p>           </td>           <td width=\"383\" valign=\"bottom\">             <p>&nbsp; [$1, text 60] </p>           </td>         </tr>         <tr>           <td width=\"231\" valign=\"bottom\">             <p>Co si dala v restauraci?</p>           </td>           <td width=\"383\" valign=\"bottom\">             <p>&nbsp; [$1, text 60] </p>           </td>         </tr>         <tr>           <td width=\"231\" valign=\"bottom\">             <p>Co pila?</p>           </td>           <td width=\"383\" valign=\"bottom\">             <p>&nbsp; [$1, text 60] </p>           </td>         </tr>         <tr>           <td width=\"231\" valign=\"bottom\">             <p>Co dÄlala v restauraci?</p>           </td>           <td width=\"383\" valign=\"bottom\">             <p>&nbsp; [$1, text 60] </p>           </td>         </tr>         <tr>           <td width=\"231\" valign=\"bottom\">             <p>Komu psala dopis?</p>           </td>           <td width=\"383\" valign=\"bottom\">             <p>&nbsp; [$1, text 60] </p>           </td>         </tr>         <tr>           <td width=\"231\" valign=\"bottom\">             <p>Co poslouchala?</p>           </td>           <td width=\"383\" valign=\"bottom\">             <p>&nbsp; [$1, text 60] </p>           </td>         </tr>         <tr>           <td width=\"231\" valign=\"bottom\">             <p>Kdy pĹiÂel Jim?</p>           </td>           <td width=\"383\" valign=\"bottom\">             <p>&nbsp; [$1, text 60] </p>           </td>         </tr>         <tr>           <td width=\"231\" valign=\"bottom\">             <p>Co Ĺekl Jim?</p>           </td>           <td width=\"383\" valign=\"bottom\">             <p>&nbsp; [$1, text 60] </p>           </td>         </tr>         <tr>           <td width=\"231\" valign=\"bottom\">             <p>A co dÄlala Anna?</p>           </td>           <td width=\"383\" valign=\"bottom\">             <p>&nbsp; [$1, text 60] </p>           </td>         </tr>       </table>', 3, ''),
(1509, 1, 'FiktivnĂ­ interview s V. Havlem (Reading U5)', NULL, 49, '', '    <h2>FiktivnĂ­ Noviny: Rozhovor s&nbsp;VĂĄclavem Havlem v&nbsp;roce 2000</h2>        <table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\">          <tr>            <td width=\"50%\" valign=\"top\">              <p>Toto              je fiktivnĂ­ interview, kterĂŠ poskytl FiktivnĂ­m novinĂĄm prezident              ÄeskĂŠ republiky VĂĄclav Havel.              </p>              <p><b>Redaktor:              </b>DobrĂ˝ den              pane prezidente. MĹŻÂete mi odpovÄdÄt na nÄkolik osobnĂ­ch              otĂĄzek?              </p>              <p><b>Prezident:              </b>Ale jistÄ.              Co chcete vÄdÄt?              </p>              <p><b>Redaktor:              </b>Jak dlouho              jste strĂĄvil ve vÄzenĂ­?              </p>              <p><b>Prezident:              </b>Ve vÄzenĂ­              jsem byl dvakrĂĄt. PoprvĂŠ v&nbsp;roce devatenĂĄct set sedmdesĂĄt              devÄt, potom co jsem podepsal Chartu 77. To jsem strĂĄvil v&nbsp;cele              tĂŠmÄĹ ÄtyĹi roky. BÄhem tĂŠ doby jsem napsal svou knihu Dopisy              Olze. PodruhĂŠ jsem Âel do vÄzenĂ­ v&nbsp;roce devatenĂĄct set              osmdesĂĄt devÄt, ale to jen na nÄkolik mÄsĂ­cĹŻ. V&nbsp;listopadu              toho roku jsem byl propuÂtÄn z&nbsp;vÄzeĹskĂŠ nemocnice a              v&nbsp;prosinci jsem byl zvolen prezidentem.              </p>              <p><b>Redaktor:              </b>Jste vĂ­ce              spisovatel nebo vĂ­ce politik?              </p>              <p><b>Prezident:              </b>To je tÄÂkĂĄ              otĂĄzka. SamozĹejmÄ mÄ velmi zajĂ­mĂĄ literatura a pĹedevÂĂ­m              divadlo, ale uÂ od sedmdesĂĄtĂ˝ch let jsem minimĂĄlnÄ padesĂĄt              procent svĂŠho Äasu vÄnoval politice a prĂĄci pro veĹejnost. NapĹĂ­klad              mezi lety devatenĂĄct set ÂedesĂĄt tĹi a devatenĂĄct set              sedmdesĂĄt osm jsem napsal dvanĂĄct her. Od roku sedmdesĂĄt sedm              jsem jich ale napsal jen asi ÄtyĹi. Zato jsem ale napsal dvÄ              knihy politickĂ˝ch esejĹŻ a samozĹejmÄ nesÄetnĂŠ mnoÂstvĂ­              projevĹŻ.              </p>              <p><b>Redaktor:              </b>MĹŻÂete naÂim              ÄtenĂĄĹĹŻm ĹĂ­ct nÄco o svĂŠm vztahu k&nbsp;ÂenĂĄm?              </p>              <p><b>Prezident:              </b>Vy mi              dĂĄvĂĄte samĂŠ obtĂ­ÂnĂŠ otĂĄzky. Jak vĂ­te, moje prvnĂ­ Âena Olga              zemĹela pĹed ÄtyĹmi lety na rakovinu plic. JejĂ­ prĂĄce v&nbsp;charitativnĂ­ch              organizacĂ­ch z&nbsp;nĂ­ uÄinila velmi populĂĄrnĂ­ osobnost a proto              takĂŠ na jejĂ­ pohĹeb pĹiÂli tisĂ­ce lidĂ­. Z&nbsp;toho dĹŻvodu              bylo pro moji druhou Âenu Dagmar velmi nesnadnĂŠ zĂ­skat pĹĂ­zeĹ              ÄeskĂŠ veĹejnosti. Jako bĂ˝valĂĄ populĂĄrnĂ­ hereÄka si musela              ona i obÄanĂŠ ÄeskĂŠ republiky dlouho zvykat na jejĂ­ novou roli.              JĂĄ sĂĄm jsem vÂdy cĂ­til k&nbsp;ÂenĂĄm Ăşctu a povaÂoval jsem              jejich Ăşlohu ve veĹejnĂŠm ÂivotÄ za dĹŻleÂitou. Ke svĂŠmu              intimnĂ­mu Âivotu se zde radÂi nechci vyjadĹovat.              </p>              <p>&nbsp;</td>            <td width=\"10%\" valign=\"top\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"fictit10.jpg\" width=\"75\" height=\"93\"><br>              VĂĄclav Havel              <p>&nbsp;</p>              <p><img border=\"0\" src=\"fictit11.jpg\" width=\"75\" height=\"100\"><br>              Olga HavlovĂĄ</p>              <p>&nbsp;</p>              <p><img border=\"0\" src=\"fictit12.jpg\" width=\"73\" height=\"102\"><br>              Dagmar HavlovĂĄ<br>              <br>              Info source:<br>              <a href=\"http://www.hrad.cz\">hrad.cz</a></td>          </tr>        </table>        <h3>Content questions</h3>        <p>Why        was Havel incarcerated the first time?<br> [$1, text 90]        <p>How        much time has he spent in prison? [$1, text 10]        <p>What        did he do during his first time in jail?<br> [$1, text 90]        <p>What        followed his second imprisonment?<br> [$1, text 90]        <p>How        many plays has Havel written since 1950? What were his other written        works?<br> [$1, textarea 90,2]        <p>What        was the cause of death of HavelÂs first wife? [$1, text 10]        <p>How        many people attended Olga HavlovĂĄÂs        funeral? [$1, text 10]        <p>What        was Dagmar HavlovĂĄÂs occupation before she married the        president? [$1, text 10]        <p>How        did the public view the presidentÂs remarriage?       <br> [$1, textarea 90,2]        <p>How        does Havel feel about women in public life?       <p> [$1, textarea 90,2]        <h3>Language questions</h3>        <p>Identify        all datives in nouns, pronouns and adjectives, both singular and plural        and show whether they are driven by a verb or a preposition.       <p> [$1, textarea 90,6]        <p>What        is the difference between given numbers in years and counting of other        figures between one and two thousand?<br> [$1, textarea 90,2]        <p>Find        three ways of saying ÂdifficultÂ.<br> [$1, textarea 90,2]        <p>Find        three different ways of expressing sequence of events and/or causality        (prepositions, adverbs, conjunctions).<br> [$1, textarea 90,2]        <p>Find        at least ten vocabulary items which you consider typical of the newspaper        interview style.<br> [$1, textarea 90,6]  ', 3, ''),
(1510, 1, 'Jokes and Proverbs (Reading U5)', NULL, 49, '', '     <h2>PĹĂ­slovĂ­</h2>        <table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\">          <tr>            <td width=\"50%\" valign=\"top\">   [$1, textarea 40,6]   </td>            <td width=\"50%\" valign=\"top\"><img src=\"/tuit/img/reading/jokes_13.gif\" width=\"321\" height=\"163></td>          </tr>        </table>        <p>Translate and identify the        following grammar: past tense, use of dative, use of infinitive. Try to        find English equivalents.</p>        <h2>Anekdoty</h2>        <table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\">          <tr>            <td width=\"50%\" valign=\"top\"><img src=\"/tuit/img/reading/jokes_14.gif\" width=\"348\" height=\"217></td>            <td width=\"50%\" valign=\"top\">   [$1, textarea 40,6]   </td>          </tr>        </table> ', 3, ''),
(1511, 1, 'Likes and Dislikes (Reading U5)', NULL, 49, '', '        <h2>Kdo mĂĄ rĂĄd dobrĂŠ jĂ­dlo</h2>         <p>Moje         rodina jsou vÂichni gurmĂĄni, ale jenom moje maminka rĂĄda vaĹĂ­.         Maminka mĂĄ rĂĄda tradiÄnĂ­ ÄeskĂĄ jĂ­dla, jako knedlĂ­ky a vepĹovĂŠ         maso. Mamince ale vĹŻbec nechutnajĂ­ ÄĂ­nskĂĄ jĂ­dla. MĂŠmu tatĂ­nkovi         nejvĂ­c chutnĂĄ rĂ˝Âe a nÄjakĂĄ dobrĂĄ omĂĄÄka. KnedlĂ­ky s&nbsp;masem         mu moc nechutnajĂ­, ale mĂĄ rĂĄd ovocnĂŠ knedlĂ­ky. MÄ chutnĂĄ vÂechno,         ale rĂĄd chodĂ­m do restaurace, protoÂe tam jĂ­dla nejen dobĹe chutnajĂ­,         ale taky hezky vypadajĂ­. RĂĄd jĂ­m jĂ­dlo, kterĂŠ se mi lĂ­bĂ­. TatĂ­nkovi         se zase lĂ­bĂ­ klasickĂĄ hudba u nedÄlnĂ­ho obÄda. Moje sestra nemĂĄ rĂĄda         jĂ­dlo. PoĹĂĄd drÂĂ­ nÄjakou dietu, protoÂe se jĂ­ lĂ­bĂ­ ÂtĂ­hlĂŠ         modelky. BohuÂel jĂ­ moc chutnĂĄ ÄokolĂĄda, takÂe dieta nestaÄĂ­. NaÂtÄstĂ­         taky sestra rĂĄda cviÄĂ­.</p>       <p><b>Fill in the chart in Czech and       translate</b></p>       <table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\">         <tr>           <td width=\"67\" valign=\"top\">             <p>&nbsp;</p>           </td>           <td width=\"138\" valign=\"top\">             <p><b>rĂĄd             dÄlat                          </b></p>           </td>           <td width=\"138\" valign=\"top\">             <p><b>mĂ­t             rĂĄd                          </b></p>           </td>           <td width=\"138\" valign=\"top\">             <p><b>lĂ­bit             se                          </b></p>           </td>           <td width=\"138\" valign=\"top\">             <p><b>chutnat                          </b></p>           </td>         </tr>         <tr>           <td width=\"67\" valign=\"top\">             <p align=\"left\"><b>matka                          </b></p>           </td>           <td width=\"138\" valign=\"top\">             <p align=\"left\">rĂĄda             