(1514, 1, 'Opera review - dative (Reading U5)', NULL, 49, '', '      <p>Find datives and translate them.</p>         <h3>ÄeskĂĄ opera v New Yorku</h3>         <p>AmeriÄanĂŠ         ÄeskĂŠ kultuĹe nerozumĂ­, Ĺekl MladĂŠ FrontÄ o newyorkskĂŠ adaptaci         znĂĄmĂŠ Smetanovy opery profesor muzikologie FrantiÂek KalĂĄbr. Jestli         mĹŻÂeme profesoru KalĂĄbrovi vÄĹit, je americkĂĄ interpretace hodnÄ         ÂpatnĂĄ. HlavnĂ­ problĂŠm je ten, Âe americkĂ˝ reÂisĂŠr dal roli JenĂ­ka         pĹĂ­liÂ starĂŠmu herci.</p>         <p>AmerickĂŠmu         publiku se ovÂem opera lĂ­bĂ­ a na konci ProdanĂŠ nevÄstÄ dlouho         aplaudujĂ­.</p>         <p>V         Americe je ÄeskĂĄ klasickĂĄ hudba velmi populĂĄrnĂ­. Publikum mĂĄ rĂĄdo         pĹedevÂĂ­m operu, ale lĂ­bĂ­ se mu i symfonie.</p>       <h3>Content questions</h3>       <p>What is the name of the opera?  [$1, text] </p>       <p>Who is the author of the opera?  [$1, text] </p>       <p>What is the Czech word for       ÂaudienceÂ.  [$1, text] </p>       <p>What is the problem with the       American adaptation?<br>        [$1, textarea 60,2] </p>       <p>What is the difference between the       American audienceÂs attitude to Czech opera and symphony?<br>        [$1, textarea 60,2] </p>       <h3>Language questions</h3>       <p>Find datives and determine their       nominative form.<br>        [$1, textarea 60,4] </p>       <p>Find places where English would       use the preposition ÂofÂ and Czech makes do with an ending. What is       the ending?<br>        [$1, textarea 60,4] </p>       <p>What is the root of the word <i>hlavnĂ­</i>?<br>        [$1, text 60] </p>       <p>Find       three synonymous ways of saying <i>moc</i>.<br>        [$1, textarea 60,3] </p>       <p>Explain the grammatical difference       between <i>mĂ­t rĂĄd </i>and       <i>lĂ­bit se</i>compared to English and to each other.<br>        [$1, textarea 60,4]  ', 3, ''),
(1515, 1, 'ÄeskĂĄ stĂĄtnĂ­ hymna (Reading U6)', '', 49, '', '<h2>ÄeskĂĄ stĂĄtnĂ­ hymna</h2>\r\n<p>Tato pĂ­seĹ se stala stĂĄtnĂ­ hymnou Äeskoslovenska v&nbsp;roce 1919. PoprvĂŠ se objevila ve hĹe, kterou napsal vĂ˝znamnĂ˝ ÄeskĂ˝ dramatik Josef KajetĂĄn Tyl v&nbsp;roce 1834. Hra sama nebyla velice ĂşspÄÂnĂĄ, ale pĂ­seĹ, kterou na konci zpĂ­val slepĂ˝ houslista, se stala velice populĂĄrnĂ­, nejen v&nbsp;ÄechĂĄch, ale i v&nbsp;jinĂ˝ch slovanskĂ˝ch zemĂ­ch. Hudbu napsal FrantiÂek&nbsp; Âkroup.</p>\r\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"451\"><p><img height=\"346\" alt=\"The anthem score\" src=\"/tuit/img/reading/czech_2.gif\" width=\"371\" />\r\n <font size=\"1\"><br />\r\nListen at <a href=\"http://digilander.iol.it/nationalanthems/inninazionali/czechrepublic.mid\">http://digilander.iol.it/nationalanthems</a>\r\n &nbsp;</font>\r\n </p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"375\"><table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"68%\"></td>\r\n<td width=\"32%\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"68%\">Kde domov mĹŻj?<br />\r\nKde domov mĹŻj?<br />\r\nVoda huÄĂ­ po luÄinĂĄch.<br />\r\nBory ÂumĂ­ po skalinĂĄch.<br />\r\nV&nbsp;sadÄ skvĂ­ se jara kvÄt.<br />\r\nZemskĂ˝ rĂĄj to na pohled.<br />\r\nA to je ta krĂĄsnĂĄ zemÄ.<br />\r\nZemÄ ÄeskĂĄ, domov mĹŻj.<br />\r\nZemÄ ÄeskĂĄ, domov mĹŻj.</td>\r\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"32%\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><b>Translate the introduction and the text of the anthem.<br />\r\n</b>\r\n[$1, textarea 70,15] </p>\r\n<p><b>Vocabulary: </b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>huÄet Â roar, ÂumÄt Â murmur, skvÄt se Â appear gloriously, bory - woods, luÄiny Â meadows, skaliny - rocks </p>\r\n<p><b>Take note of the position of adjectives and possessive pronouns, and compare it with their normal use. Suggest an explanation of the difference.<br />\r\n</b>\r\n[$1, textarea 70,2] </p>', 3, NULL),
(1516, 1, 'Czech poem - Jan Holub (Reading U6)', NULL, 49, '', ' <h2>ÄeskĂĄ poezie                  </h2>         <table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"5\">           <tr>             <td width=\"37%\" valign=\"top\">       <h3>Hlava<br>       Miroslav Holub (1923 - 1998)              </h3>             </td>             <td width=\"63%\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, text 20] </td>           </tr>           <tr>             <td width=\"37%\" valign=\"top\">       <p>Je       tam kosmickĂĄ loÄ<br>       a       projekt<br>       zruÂit       hodiny na piano.</p>             </td>             <td width=\"63%\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, textarea 60,2] </td>           </tr>           <tr>             <td width=\"37%\" valign=\"top\">       <p>A       je tam<br>       Noemova archa,<br>       kterĂĄ       bude prvnĂ­.</p>             </td>             <td width=\"63%\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, textarea 60,2] </td>           </tr>           <tr>             <td width=\"37%\" valign=\"top\">       <p>A       je tam<br>       ĂşplnÄ       novĂ˝ ptĂĄk,<br>       ĂşplnÄ       novĂ˝ zajĂ­c.<br>       ĂşplnÄ       novĂ˝ ÄmelĂĄÄek.</p>             </td>             <td width=\"63%\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, textarea 60,3] </td>           </tr>           <tr>             <td width=\"37%\" valign=\"top\">       <p>Je       tam Ĺeka, kterĂĄ teÄe nahoru.<br>       Je       tam nĂĄsobilka.<br>       Je       tam antihmota.</p>             </td>             <td width=\"63%\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, textarea 60,2] </td>           </tr>           <tr>             <td width=\"37%\" valign=\"top\">       <p>A       vĹŻbec to nejde uÄesat.<br>       DomnĂ­vĂĄm       se,<br>       Âe       to, co nejde vĹŻbec uÄesat,<br>       je hlava.</p>             </td>             <td width=\"63%\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, textarea 60,3] </td>           </tr>           <tr>             <td width=\"37%\" valign=\"top\">       <p>Velmi       mnoho si slibuji<br>       od okolnosti,<br>       Âe       tolik lidĂ­ mĂĄ hlavu.</p>             </td>             <td width=\"63%\" valign=\"top\"> [$1, textarea 60,2] </td>           </tr>         </table>       <h4>Before you translate: Identify verbs in the third       person singular and first person singular (guess their infinitives and       confirm with the dictionary using conjugation charts).</h4>       <p> [$1, textarea 90,4]               </p>       <h4>Translate and describe two uses (possible       translations) of <i>je </i>in Czech</h4>       <p> [$1, textarea 90,2]  ', 3, ''),
(1517, 1, 'Words in Czech Website Addresses (Reading U6)', NULL, 49, '', '      <p>Web site addresses cannot use       letters with diacritics. Here are some real Czech web sites which had to       do without <i>hĂĄÄky </i>and       <i>hĂĄÄky</i>. Use a dictionary to put them back. You can also check       whether the sites actually do what the names suggest.</p>       <p align=\"center\"><map name=\"FPMap0\">       <area href=\"http://www.seznam.cz\" shape=\"rect\" coords=\"91, 134, 214, 162\">       <area href=\"http://www.obchodnidum.cz\" shape=\"rect\" coords=\"260, 155, 412, 175\">       <area href=\"http://www.lidovenoviny.cz\" shape=\"rect\" coords=\"442, 164, 586, 198\">       <area href=\"http://www.dane.cz\" shape=\"rect\" coords=\"92, 192, 192, 210\">       <area href=\"http://www.trafika.cz\" shape=\"rect\" coords=\"275, 202, 399, 228\">       <area href=\"http://www.slovnik.cz\" shape=\"rect\" coords=\"470, 216, 584, 248\">       <area href=\"http://www.ceskaskola.cz\" shape=\"rect\" coords=\"94, 238, 230, 264\">       <area href=\"http://www.hrad.cz\" shape=\"rect\" coords=\"280, 252, 408, 279\">       <area href=\"http://www.cestina.cz\" shape=\"rect\" coords=\"468, 268, 589, 302\">       <area href=\"http://www.volby.cz\" shape=\"rect\" coords=\"92, 287, 191, 316\">       <area href=\"http://www.vlada.cz\" shape=\"rect\" coords=\"282, 303, 382, 329\">       <area href=\"http://www.pravo.cz\" shape=\"rect\" coords=\"481, 318, 587, 352\">       <area href=\"http://www.divadlo.cz\" shape=\"rect\" coords=\"92, 336, 203, 368\">       <area href=\"http://www.kancelar.cz\" shape=\"rect\" coords=\"271, 354, 400, 384\">       <area href=\"http://www.knedlik.cz\" shape=\"rect\" coords=\"461, 363, 589, 403\">       <area href=\"http://www.kuchyne.cz\" shape=\"rect\" coords=\"90, 387, 218, 419\">       <area href=\"http://www.ubytovani.cz\" shape=\"rect\" coords=\"266, 399, 403, 436\">       <area href=\"http://www.zdravi.cz\" shape=\"rect\" coords=\"481, 420,