Ä pojiÂtÄnĂ­?<br>  [$1, text 70] </p> <p>14.&nbsp;&nbsp; Kolik mĹŻÂou stĂĄt jĂ­dla, kterĂŠ nezahrnuje cena?<br>  [$1, text 70] </p> <p>15.&nbsp;&nbsp; Co mĹŻÂou turisti dÄlat u moĹe?<br>  [$1, text 70] </p> <h3>Language Questions</h3> <p>1.&nbsp; Find all genitives and explain their use (including in the questions).<br>  [$1, textarea 70,5] </p> <p>2.&nbsp; What case is the word <i>transportation</i> and why?<br>  [$1, textarea 70,2] </p> <p>3.&nbsp; Find all Czech words designating transportation and motion.<br>  [$1, textarea 70,5] </p> <p>4.&nbsp; Find two words meaning sightseeing.<br>  [$1, textarea 70,2] </p> <p>5.&nbsp; Look at all question words in the Content Questions and find English equivalents.<br>  [$1, textarea 70,5] </p>', 3, ''),
(1525, 1, 'Od mÄsta k mÄstu (Reading U8)', NULL, 49, '', '<h2 align=\"left\">Od mÄsta k mÄstu (KarlĹŻv tĂ˝dennĂ­ vĂ˝let po ÄeskĂ˝ch a moravskĂ˝ch mÄstech)</h2> <p><img hspace=\"12\" src=\"czechmap.jpg\" align=\"left\" width=\"355\" height=\"210\">Karel se narodil v&nbsp;malĂŠ vesnici nedaleko DÄÄĂ­na. VÂdycky ale chtÄl vidÄt celou Äeskou republiku. Proto jel letos o prĂĄzdninĂĄch na velkĂ˝ vĂ˝let. ZaÄal v&nbsp;pondÄlĂ­ v&nbsp;DÄÄĂ­nÄ, odkud jel autobusem do Liberce. V&nbsp;Liberci se Âel podĂ­vat do muzea a taky Âel na horu JeÂtÄd. Byl jasnĂ˝ den a z&nbsp;JeÂtÄdu Karel vidÄl do vzdĂĄlenosti mnoha kilometrĹŻ. DruhĂ˝ den jel Karel vlakem z&nbsp;Liberce do Pardubic. UÂ od Hradce KrĂĄlovĂŠ se tÄÂil na pardubickĂ˝ pernĂ­k. V&nbsp;PardubicĂ­ch se Âel podĂ­vat k tovĂĄrnÄ, kde vynalezli Semtex. Nedaleko byla restaurace, kam si Âel Karel odpoÄinout. Z&nbsp;Pardubic vyjel ve stĹedu brzo rĂĄno a odpoledne byl jeho vlak na MoravÄ. V&nbsp;OstravÄ se Karlovi <img alt=\"Lahev\" src=\"budvarbeerbottle.jpg\" align=\"right\" width=\"61\" height=\"200\">moc nelĂ­bilo, protoÂe tam byl ÂpatnĂ˝ vzduch. U Ostravy je totiÂ mnoho uhelnĂ˝ch dolĹŻ. DruhĂ˝ den jel autobusem pĹes Olomouc do Brna. V&nbsp;Olomouci se zastavil jen na nÄkolik hodin. Âel do obchodu a koupil si tam slavnĂ˝ olomouckĂ˝ sĂ˝r. K&nbsp;veÄeru pĹijel do Brna a Âel do hotelu, kterĂ˝ byl hned vedle nĂĄdraÂĂ­. CelĂ˝ dalÂĂ­ den chodil po BrnÄ a veÄer Âel na novou hru do slavnĂŠho Divadla na provĂĄzku. V&nbsp;sobotu odjel Karel z&nbsp;Moravy do Äech. ZaÄal v&nbsp;Praze, kde strĂĄvil ÄtyĹi dny, protoÂe tam mohl bydlet u kamarĂĄda. Od nedÄle do stĹedy vidÄl vÂechny turistickĂŠ atrakce a ve Ätvrtek rĂĄno odjel autobusem do ÄeskĂŠho Krumlova. ÄeskĂ˝ Krumlov, kterĂ˝ je od roku 1992 na Seznamu vĂ˝znamnĂ˝ch pamĂĄtek UNESCA. Z&nbsp;Krumlova, kde pil ÄeskobudÄjovickĂŠ pivo Budvar odjel do PlznÄ, protoÂe chtÄl takĂŠ ochutnat PlzeĹskĂ˝ leÂĂĄk a Gambrinus. NeÂ se vrĂĄtil po dvou tĂ˝dnech do DÄÄĂ­na zastavil se jeÂtÄ Karel v&nbsp;nejzĂĄpadnÄjÂĂ­m mÄstÄ ÄeskĂŠ republiky Chebu.</p> <h4>Draw up the itinerary of KarelÂs journey on the map. Indicate mode of travel and time spent at each place. Make sure you use the Nominative forms (the map will help).</h4> <p> [$1, textarea 60,5] </p> <h4>List cities in Moravia.</h4> <p> [$1, textarea 60,2] </p> <h4>List points of interest for each city where available.</h4> <p> [$1, textarea 60,5] </p> <h4>Find and compare verbs based on <i>jĂ­t </i>and <i>jet</i>.</h4> <p> [$1, textarea 60,3] </p> <h4>Identify and explain the use of genitive without a preposition.</h4> <p> [$1, textarea 60,3] </p> <h4>Complete this chart with prepositions and their cases from the text.</h4> <table cellSpacing=\"3\" cellPadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"876\">   <tbody>     <tr>       <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"206\">         <p align=\"center\"><b>Kde?</b></p>       </td>       <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"364\">         <p align=\"center\"><b>Kam?</b></p>       </td>       <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"284\">         <p align=\"center\"><b>Odkud?</b></p>       </td>     </tr>     <tr>       <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"206\">         <p align=\"left\"><b>v</b> (Kom? Äem?)</p>       </td>       <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"364\">         <p align=\"center\"> [$1, text] </p>       </td>       <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"284\">         <p align=\"center\"> [$1, text]        </td>     </tr>     <tr>       <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"206\">         <p align=\"left\"><b>na </b>(Kom? Äem?)</p>       </td>       <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"364\">         <p align=\"center\"> [$1, text]        </td>       <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"284\">         <p align=\"center\"> [$1, text]        </td>     </tr>     <tr>       <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"206\">         <p align=\"left\"><b>u </b>(Koho? Äeho?)<b><br>         vedle </b>(Koho? Äeho?)<br>         <b>blĂ­zko </b>(Koho? Äeho?)<br>         <b>nedaleko </b>(Koho? Äeho?)</td>       <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"364\">         <p align=\"center\"> [$1, textarea 20,3]        </td>       <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"284\">         <p align=\"center\"> [$1, textarea 20,3]        </td>     </tr>   </tbody> </table> <h4>Which prepositions in the text could be used as answers to the following questions?</h4> <table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\">   <tr>     <td width=\"25%\"><b><i>Kudy?</i></b></td>     <td width=\"25%\"><b><i>Kdy? </i></b></td>     <td width=\"25%\"><b><i>Odkdy? </i></b></td>     <td width=\"25%\"><b><i>Dokdy?</i></b></td>   </tr>   <tr>     <td width=\"25%\"> [$1, text] </td>     <td width=\"25%\"> [$1, text] </td>     <td width=\"25%\"> [$1, text] </td>     <td width=\"25%\"> [$1, text] </td>   </tr> </table> ', 3, ''),
(1526, 1, 'Czech Parliamentary Parties (Reading U8)', NULL, 49, '', '<h2>ÄeskĂŠ politickĂŠ strany v&nbsp;parlamentu</h2>  <p align=\"left\"><img src=\"/tuit/img/reading/stranyvparlamentu.jpg\" border=\"0\" width=\"540\" height=\"283></p>   <p><b>Kolik hlasĹŻ majĂ­ politickĂŠ strany v parlamentu? </b>SociĂĄlnĂ­   demokratĂŠ zĂ­skali ve volbĂĄch nejvĂ­ce hlasĹŻ a majĂ­ sedmdesĂĄt ÄtyĹi   mandĂĄtĹŻ. Komunisti majĂ­ v&nbsp;parlamentu dvacet ÄtyĹi hlasĹŻ. Za Unii   Svobody je v&nbsp;parlamentu devatenĂĄct poslancĹŻ. Lidovci majĂ­ deset   procent hlasĹŻ a dvacet mandĂĄtĹŻ. ObÄanÂtĂ­ demokratĂŠ majĂ­ ÂedesĂĄt ÄtyĹi   kĹesel.</p> <p><b>Use numbers of seats to match nicknames of parties with their nicknames.</b></p> <p> [$1, textarea 70,3] </p> <p><b>Explain the use of genitive for counting.</b></p> <p> [$1, textarea 70,3] </p>', 3, ''),
