(1531, 1, 'Weather Forecast (Reading U9)', NULL, 49, '', '<h2>PoÄasĂ­</h2> <p><img alt=\"vysvÄtlivky, legenda\" hspace=\"12\" src=\"pocasi1.gif\" align=\"left\" width=\"148\" height=\"205\"><b>PĹedpovÄÄ poÄasĂ­ pro ÄR na sobotu aÂ pondÄlĂ­.</b>V sobotu se na ĂşzemĂ­ ÄeskĂŠ republiky pĹechodnÄ rozÂĂ­ĹĂ­ nevĂ˝raznĂ˝ vĂ˝bÄÂek vyÂÂĂ­ho tlaku vzduchu od jihozĂĄpadu. PoÄasĂ­ na MoravÄ a ve Slezsku ovlivĹuje frontĂĄlnĂ­ rozhranĂ­ nad Polskem a Slovenskem. V noci mĹŻÂe bĂ˝t oblaÄno aÂ zataÂeno a mĂ­sty dĂŠÂÂ nebo pĹehĂĄĹky. NoÄnĂ­ teploty Âest aÂ dva stupnÄ Celsia. PĹes den mĹŻÂeme v ÄechĂĄch Äekat oblaÄno aÂ polojasno a ojedinÄle pĹehĂĄĹky, na horĂĄch snÄhovĂŠ. Na MoravÄ a ve Slezsku se oÄekĂĄvĂĄ oblaÄno aÂ zataÂeno a mĂ­sty dĂŠÂÂ nebo pĹehĂĄĹky. DennĂ­ teploty ÄtyĹi aÂ osm stupĹĹŻ Celsia. Teplota vzduchu v nadmoĹskĂŠ vĂ˝Âce 1000 metrĹŻ se oÄekĂĄvĂĄ v ÄechĂĄch plus jeden stupeĹ Celsia, na MoravÄ a ve Slezsku tĹi stupnÄ Celsia. OÄekĂĄvĂĄme takĂŠ jihozĂĄpadnĂ­ aÂ zĂĄpadnĂ­ vĂ­tr, na MoravÄ a ve Slezsku severozĂĄpadnĂ­, o rychlosti 11 aÂ 25 km/h. Po oba dny se oÄekĂĄvajĂ­ rĂĄno a dopoledne mĂ­sty mlhy nebo zataÂeno nĂ­zkou oblaÄnostĂ­. Po rozpuÂtÄnĂ­ mlh a nĂ­zkĂŠ oblaÄnosti bude oblaÄno aÂ polojasno. NoÄnĂ­ teploty plus dva aÂ minus dva stupnÄ Celsia, dennĂ­ teploty ÄtyĹi aÂ osm stupĹĹŻ Celsia. Slunce vychĂĄzĂ­ v nedÄli v 07:19 a zapadĂĄ v 16:11, MÄsĂ­c v nedÄli nevychĂĄzĂ­.</p> <h4>What days does the forecast cover?</h4> <p> [$1, textarea 60,2] </p> <h4>Where is the frontal system and what does it influence?</h4> <p> [$1, textarea 60,2] </p> <h4>When are local fogs expected?</h4> <p> [$1, textarea 60,2] </p> <h4>At what altitude is the temperature one degree Celsius.</h4> <p> [$1, textarea 60,2] </p> <h4>What are the expected night temperatures?</h4> <p> [$1, textarea 60,2] </p> <h4>What is the wind direction and strength in Silesia?</h4> <p> [$1, textarea 60,2] </p> <h4>What weather is expected during the day?</h4> <p> [$1, textarea 60,2] </p> <h4><i>Language question</i>:Explain the difference in the form of the word for <i>degree</i>.</h4> <p> [$1, textarea 60,4] </p> <h4><i>Language question</i>: Find dictionary forms of all verbs which are not already dictionary forms.</h4> <p> [$1, textarea 60,4] </p>', 3, ''),
(1532, 1, 'Weather in Europe (Reading U9)', NULL, 49, '', '<h2>JakĂŠ je dnes poÄasĂ­ v&nbsp;EvropÄ?</h2> <table cellSpacing=\"3\" cellPadding=\"0\" width=\"876\" border=\"0\">   <tbody>     <tr>       <td vAlign=\"top\" noWrap width=\"384\">         <p align=\"left\"><img src=\"/tuit/img/reading/pocasivevrope.gif\" border=\"0\" width=\"360\" height=\"271\"><br>         <a href=http://www.idnes.cz\">http://www.idnes.cz</a>&nbsp;</p>       </td>       <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"488\">         <p align=\"left\"><b>Answer questions in Czech with places on the map</b><br>         Kde je polojasno?<br>          [$1, text] <br>         Kde prÂĂ­ a je zataÂeno?<br>          [$1, text] <br>         Kde je polojasno s&nbsp;deÂtÄm?<br>          [$1, text] <br>         Kde je zĂĄroveĹ snĂ­h a mrĂĄz?<br>          [$1, text] <br>         Kde je zataÂeno?<br>          [$1, text] <br>         Kde svĂ­tĂ­ slunce?<br>          [$1, text] <br>         Kde je sluneÄno ale jen ÂestnĂĄct stupĹĹŻ celsia ?<br>          [$1, text] </p>       </td>     </tr>   </tbody> </table>', 3, ''),
(1533, 1, 'Czech Year and Holidays (U9)', NULL, 49, '', '<h2>ÄeskĂ˝ rok a jeho svĂĄtky</h2> <p><b>Zima </b>ÄeskĂ˝ rok zaÄĂ­nĂĄ v&nbsp;lednu. PrvnĂ­ svĂĄtek je NovĂ˝ rok, kterĂ˝ je prvnĂ­ho ledna. Leden je ale uÂ druhĂ˝ mÄsĂ­c zimy, kterĂĄ zaÄĂ­nĂĄ v&nbsp;prosinci. DalÂĂ­ svĂĄtek je hned ÂestĂŠho ledna, kdy ÄeÂi slavĂ­ TĹi krĂĄle. DruhĂ˝ mÄsĂ­c roku je Ăşnor. V&nbsp;Ăşnoru se tradiÄnÄ na ÄeskĂŠm venkovÄ slavil Masopust, kdy lidĂŠ tancujĂ­ po vesnici v&nbsp;maskĂĄch. V&nbsp;prosinci se slavĂ­ dva velkĂŠ svĂĄtky: MikulĂĄÂ (ÂestĂŠho prosince) a VĂĄnoce (dvacĂĄtĂŠho ÄtvrtĂŠho prosince). O vĂĄnocĂ­ch si lidĂŠ dĂĄvajĂ­ dĂĄrky, strojĂ­ stromky a jedĂ­ kapry.<br>  [$1, textarea 70,4] </p> <p><b>Jaro </b>zaÄĂ­nĂĄ jako vÂude dvacĂĄtĂŠho prvnĂ­ho bĹezna. V&nbsp;bĹeznu nebo v&nbsp; dubnu pĹichĂĄzĂ­ velikonoce. O VelikonocĂ­ch chodĂ­ dÄti po mÄstÄ na koledu a kluci honĂ­ holky s&nbsp;pomlĂĄzkou. O VelikonocĂ­ch se takĂŠ malujĂ­ vajĂ­Äka a peÄe se berĂĄnek ze sladkĂŠho tÄsta. TĹicĂĄtĂŠho dubna je den, kdy se po celĂŠ ÄeskĂŠ republice pĂĄlĂ­ ÄarodÄjnice, coÂ jsou ohnÄ a ohĹostroje, kterĂŠ se poĹĂĄdajĂ­ nÄkde za mÄstem. PrvnĂ­ kvÄten je svĂĄtek prĂĄce, ale takĂŠ svĂĄtek lĂĄsky. LidĂŠ nejdou do prĂĄce a mladĂ­ muÂi musĂ­ lĂ­bat mladĂŠ Âeny pod stromy.<br>  [$1, textarea 70,4] </p> <p><b>LĂŠto </b>PrvnĂ­ mÄsĂ­c lĂŠta je Äerven, coÂ je takĂŠ poslednĂ­ mÄsĂ­c ÂkolnĂ­ho roku. PrvnĂ­ho Äervna je MezinĂĄrodnĂ­ svĂĄtek dÄtĂ­, a proto se Äasto poĹĂĄdajĂ­ zĂĄbavnĂŠ akce jako napĹĂ­klad poutÄ. PrĂĄzdniny zaÄĂ­najĂ­ v&nbsp;Äervenci a trvajĂ­ dva mÄsĂ­ce. BÄhem prĂĄzdnin jezdĂ­ ÄeskĂŠ rodiny na dovolenou nebo na chatu. DÄti jezdĂ­ na letnĂ­ tĂĄbory. V&nbsp;Äervenci jsou takĂŠ dva dĹŻleÂitĂŠ stĂĄtnĂ­ svĂĄtky, kterĂŠ jdou jeden za druhĂ˝m. PĂĄtĂŠho Äervence si ÄeÂi pĹipomĂ­najĂ­ pĹĂ­chod Cyrila a MetodÄje, kteĹĂ­ pĹinesli do regionu vzdÄlanost v&nbsp;devĂĄtĂŠm stoletĂ­. ÂestĂŠho Äervence je vĂ˝roÄĂ­ upĂĄlenĂ­ Jana Husa, cĂ­rkevnĂ­ho reformĂĄtora, kterĂ˝ byl upĂĄlen v&nbsp;roce 1415.<br>  [$1, textarea 70,4] </p> <p><b>Podzim </b>pĹichĂĄzĂ­ v&nbsp;zĂĄĹĂ­. Âkola zaÄĂ­nĂĄ prvnĂ­ho zĂĄĹĂ­. DvacĂĄtĂŠho osmĂŠho zĂĄĹĂ­ je svĂĄtek svatĂŠho VĂĄclava, coÂ je mytickĂ˝ ochrĂĄnce ÄeskĂŠho nĂĄroda. DvacĂĄtĂŠho osmĂŠho ĹĂ­jna si ÄeÂi pĹipomĂ­najĂ­ zaloÂenĂ­ Äeskoslovenska v&nbsp;roce 1918. DruhĂŠho listopadu jsou tak zvanĂŠ DuÂiÄky, kdy ÄeÂi chodĂ­ na hĹbitovy a vzpomĂ­najĂ­ na svĂŠ blĂ­zkĂŠ, kteĹĂ­ zemĹeli.<br>  [$1, textarea 70,3] </p> <h4>When translating the text, focus on the following: <i>present forms of verbs, identifying subject and object, conjunctions and relative pronouns.</i></h4> <h4>Write out all verbs in the infinitive and assign them to one of 4 categories from <a href=\"../../reference/referencetop.htm\" target=\"_blank\"> Yellow Pages</a>. Compare the level of detail in the Yellow Pages and the dictionary.</h4> <p> [$1, textarea 70,4] </p> <h4>Try to deduce rules for giving dates in Czech.</h4> <p> [$1, textarea 70,4]  ', 3, ''),
(1534, 1, 'ÄeskĂŠ pranostiky (U9)', NULL, 49, '', '<h2>ÄeskĂŠ pranostiky</h2> <p>Pranostiky jsou ÄeskĂĄ pĹĂ­slovĂ­, kterĂĄ pĹedpovĂ­dajĂ­ poÄasĂ­.</p> <table cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\">   <tbody>     <tr>       <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"50%\">         <p>a.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Martin pĹijĂ­ÂdĂ­ na bĂ­lĂŠm koni.</p>         <p>b.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Lucie noci upije.</p>         <p>c.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Medardova kĂĄpÄ, ÄtyĹicet dnĹŻ         kape.</p>         <p>d.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Ănor bĂ­lĂ˝, pole sĂ­lĂ­.</p>         <p>e.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Na TĹi krĂĄle o skok dĂĄle.</p>         <p>f. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; BĹezen, za kamna vlezem.</p>         <p>g.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; SvatĂĄ Anna, chladna z&nbsp;rĂĄna.</p>         <p>h.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Na Hromnice o hodinu vĂ­ce.</p>         <p>i.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Na NovĂ˝ rok o slepiÄĂ­ krok.</p>         <p>j.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Duben, jeÂtÄ tam budem.</p>       </td>       <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"50%\">         <p>1.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;j. - 1 Jan</p>         <p>2.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; [$1, select:/a/b/c/d/(e)/f/g/h/i/j]   [$1, text] </p>         <p>3.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; [$1, select:/a/b/c/d/e/f/g/(h)/i/j]   [$1, text] </p>         <p>4.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; [$1, select:/a/b/c/(d)/e/f/g/h/i/j]   [$1, text] </p>         <p>5.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; [$1, select:/a/b/c/d/e/(f)/g/h/i/j]   [$1, text] </p>         <p>6.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; [$1, select:/a/b/c/d/e/f/g/h/i/(j)]   [$1, text] </p>         <p>7.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; [$1, select:/a/b/(c)/d/e/f/g/h/i/j]   [$1, text] </p>         <p>8.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; [$1, select:/a/b/c/d/e/f/(g)/h/i/j]   [$1, text] </p>         <p>9.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; [$1, select:/(a)/b/c/d/e/f/g/h/i/j]   [$1, text] </p>         <p>10.&nbsp;&nbsp;  [$1, select:/a/(b)/c/d/e/f/g/h/i/j]   [$1, text] </p>       </td>     </tr>   </tbody> </table> <p><b>Order the <i>pranostiky </i>starting with those in January. Supply dates where appropriate. (Use Czech calendar (e.g. on internet) to date the <i>pranostiky </i>referring to particular dates).</b></p> <p><b>Which <i>pranostiky </i>refer to length of day?</b>  [$1, select:/(b e h i)/f g j b/d a i j] </p> <p><b>Which <i>pranostiky </i>refer to temperature?</b>  [$1, select:/a h c/(f g j)/b h i] </p> <p><b>Which <i>pranostiky </i>refer to snow? </b> [$1, select:/b c/g j/(d a)] </p> <p><b>Which <i>pranostika </i>refers to rain? </b> [$1, select:/b/(c)/e/g] </p> <p><b>Which <i>pranostika </i>refers to harvest? </b> [$1, select:/a/c/(d)/h] </p> <p><b><i>Language question: </i>What colloquialism is present in the verbs in f) and j).</b></p> <p> [$1, textarea 60,2] </p> ', 3, ''),
(1535, 1, 'Czech and Free Time (U9)', NULL, 49, '', '<h2>ÄeÂi a jejich volnĂ˝ Äas</h2> <h3>1.  [$1, text 50] </h3> <p>PRAHA SvĹŻj volnĂ˝ Äas trĂĄvĂ­ mnoho ÄechĹŻ jinak neÂ pĹed deseti lety. NeÂ jĂ­t s pĹĂĄteli na pĂĄr piv, zĹŻstĂĄvajĂ­ lidĂŠ radÄji doma u televizorĹŻ. RozsĂĄhlĂ˝ prĹŻzkum, vypracovanĂ˝ SociologickĂ˝m Ăşstavem Akademie vÄd ÄR, zjistil, Âe vĂ­ce neÂ tĹetina dotĂĄzanĂ˝ch osob chodĂ­ dnes do hospod mĂŠnÄ Äasto neÂ v roce 1989. Restaurace a kavĂĄrny utrpÄly za deset let nejvÄtÂĂ­ pokles zĂĄjmu o svĂŠ sluÂby. ProÄ se ÄeÂi vzdĂĄvajĂ­ svĂ˝ch dĹĂ­ve velmi oblĂ­benĂ˝ch diskusnĂ­ch seancĂ­ nad pivem v zakouĹenĂ˝ch lokĂĄlech? SociologovĂŠ vidĂ­ dvÄ pĹĂ­Äiny. LidĂŠ, kteĹĂ­ navÂtÄvovali podobnĂĄ zaĹĂ­zenĂ­ nejÄastÄji (dÄlnĂ­ci, niÂÂĂ­ ĂşĹednĂ­ci), majĂ­ dnes Äasto hluboko do kapsy. Ti, co na to majĂ­ (podnikatelĂŠ, vzdÄlanÄjÂĂ­ vrstvy) zase nemajĂ­ Äas a majĂ­ takĂŠ jinĂŠ zĂĄjmy. Psycholog Slavomil HubĂĄlek pĹidĂĄvĂĄ i druhou moÂnou pĹĂ­Äinu. Ubyly nejlevnÄjÂĂ­ hospody, tzv. IV. cenovĂŠ skupiny. <i>PokraÄovĂĄnĂ­ nĂ­Âe.</i></p> <h3>2.  [$1, text 50] </h3> <p>DvÄ a pĹŻl hodiny sedĂ­ dennÄ prĹŻmÄrnĂ˝ Äech u televiznĂ­ obrazovky. ÂĂĄdnĂĄ dalÂĂ­ aktivita mu tolik volnĂŠho Äasu nezabere.</p> <p> [$1, text 50] </p> <p>Doma zĹŻstĂĄvĂĄ stĂĄle vĂ­ce ÄeskĂ˝ch obÄanĹŻ. Po pĹĂ­chodu ze zamÄstnĂĄnĂ­ se vÄtÂina spokojĂ­ jen s pasivnĂ­m trĂĄvenĂ­m volnĂŠho Äasu. DevÄt z deseti respondentĹŻ prĹŻzkumu pĹiznalo, Âe nejÄastÄji trĂĄvĂ­ svĹŻj volnĂ˝ Äas pĹed televiznĂ­ obrazovkou. K nejmĂŠnÄ provozovanĂ˝m pravidelnĂ˝m Äinnostem naopak patĹĂ­ nĂĄvÂtÄvy divadel, koncertĹŻ Äi vĂ˝stav. Velmi mĂĄlo lidĂ­ takĂŠ vyuÂĂ­vĂĄ pravidelnÄji svĂŠ volno k nĂĄvÂtÄvĂĄm kavĂĄren, restauracĂ­ Äi diskotĂŠk.</p> <p> [$1, text 50] </p> <p>PotĂŠ co pĹiÂla komerÄnĂ­ televize se staly programy mnohem pĹitaÂlivÄjÂĂ­ pro ÂirokĂŠ vrstvy publika. Do mnoha ÄeskĂ˝ch domĂĄcnostĂ­ se dostalo video. Po mobilnĂ­m telefonu je druhĂ˝m nejrychleji se rozÂiĹujĂ­cĂ­m druhem spotĹebnĂ­ho zboÂĂ­.</p> <p> [$1, text 50] </p> <p>Psycholog Slavomil HubĂĄlek upozorĹuje na zvlĂĄÂtnĂ­ skupinu mladĂ˝ch, vzdÄlanĂ˝ch lidĂ­, kteĹĂ­ sledovĂĄnĂ­ televize zcela ignorujĂ­. &quot;VÄtÂina z nich pĹĂ­stroj vĹŻbec nevlastnĂ­, nebo jej pouÂtĂ­ jen zcela vĂ˝jimeÄnÄ,&quot; ĹĂ­kĂĄ HubĂĄlek. VĂ˝zkumy doklĂĄdajĂ­, Âe jde zhruba o osm procent populace. DalÂĂ­ Äas takĂŠ v&nbsp;budoucnosti zabere internet</p> <p align=\"right\">Petr KuÄera<br> LidovĂŠ Noviny 8. 4. 2000 (upraveno a zkrĂĄceno)</p> <h4>Suggest main titles (in English) for these two connected articles (1 and 2). Compare with original titles below.</h4> <p>Deset let po listopadu chodĂ­ ÄeÂi mĂŠnÄ do hospod</p> <p>VÄtÂina ÄechĹŻ sleduje ve svĂŠm volnĂŠm Äase televizi</p> <h4>Suggest subtitles for each paragraph of the text in article 2.</h4> <h4>Summarize the whole article in 5 - 8 main points.</h4> <p> [$1, textarea 60,5] </p> ', 3, ''),
(1536, 1, 'Cartoons (U9)', NULL, 49, '', '<h2>Vtipy</h2> <table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\">   <tr>     <td width=\"50%\">       <p align=\"right\"><img src=\"/tuit/img/reading/vtip1.gif\" border=\"0\" width=\"361\" height=\"218><br>       Ty mÄ chceÂ zĹejmÄ vyprovokovat!</td>     <td width=\"50%\"> [$1, textarea 40,2] </td>   </tr>   <tr>     <td width=\"50%\">       <p align=\"right\"> [$1, textarea 40,2] </td>     <td width=\"50%\"><img alt=\"ObrĂĄzek ÄĂ­slo/No. 003\" src=\"vtip2.gif\" border=\"0\" width=\"396\" height=\"358\"></td>   </tr> </table> <table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\">   <tr>     <td width=\"50%\"><img src=\"/tuit/img/reading/vtip3.gif\" border=\"0\" width=\"500\" height=\"174></td>     <td width=\"50%\"> [$1, textarea 40,2] </td>   </tr> </table> <p align=\"left\">&nbsp;</p>', 3, ''),
(1537, 1, 'Future Plans (U10)', NULL, 49, '', '<h2>Future Plans</h2> <img height=\"789\" src=\"futureplans.gif\" width=\"549\"> <h3>Translate sentences. Note how verbs of motion are used.</h3> <table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\">   <tr>     <td width=\"15%\"><b>leden</b></td>     <td width=\"30%\"> [$1, text] </td>     <td width=\"15%\"><b>Äervenec</b></td>     <td width=\"30%\"> [$1, text] </td>   </tr>   <tr>     <td width=\"15%\"><b>Ăşnor</b></td>     <td width=\"30%\"> [$1, text] </td>     <td width=\"15%\"><b>srpen</b></td>     <td width=\"30%\"> [$1, text] </td>   </tr>   <tr>     <td width=\"15%\"><b>bĹezen</b></td>     <td width=\"30%\"> [$1, text] </td>     <td width=\"15%\"><b>zĂĄĹĂ­</b></td>     <td width=\"30%\"> [$1, text] </td>   </tr>   <tr>     <td width=\"15%\"><b>duben</b></td>     <td width=\"30%\"> [$1, text] </td>     <td width=\"15%\"><b>ĹĂ­jen</b></td>     <td width=\"30%\"> [$1, text] </td>   </tr>   <tr>     <td width=\"15%\"><b>kvÄten</b></td>     <td width=\"30%\"> [$1, text] </td>     <td width=\"15%\"><b>listopad</b></td>     <td width=\"30%\"> [$1, text] </td>   </tr>   <tr>     <td width=\"15%\"><b>Äerven</b></td>     <td width=\"30%\"> [$1, text] </td>     <td width=\"15%\"><b>prosinec</b></td>     <td width=\"30%\"> [$1, text] </td>   </tr> </table> <h3>Make 10 sentences of your own&nbsp; using the analytic future tense.</h3> <p>1.  [$1, text 60] </p> <p>2.  [$1, text 60] </p> <p>3.  [$1, text 60] </p> <p>4.  [$1, text 60] </p> <p>5.  [$1, text 60] </p> <p>6.  [$1, text 60] </p> <p>7.  [$1, text 60] </p> <p>8.  [$1, text 60] </p> <p>9.  [$1, text 60] </p> <p>10.  [$1, text 60] </p> ', 3, ''),
(1538, 1, 'Vacation plans of the Svobodas (U10)', NULL, 49, '', '<h2>Vacation plans of the Svoboda family</h2> <h3><i>DovolenĂĄ</i></h3>   <p align=\"left\"><i>BlĂ­ÂĂ­ se lĂŠto. Svobodovi plĂĄnujĂ­ dovolenou. Obvykle   jezdĂ­ v&nbsp;lĂŠtÄ spoleÄnÄ k&nbsp;moĹi, ale letos strĂĄvĂ­ dovolenou v&nbsp;ÄechĂĄch.</i></p>   <p align=\"left\"> [$1, textarea 60,2] </p>   <p align=\"left\"><i>Jejich dÄti, Alena a Pavel, chtÄjĂ­ strĂĄvit prĂĄzdniny   bez rodiÄĹŻ.</i></p>   <p align=\"left\"> [$1, textarea 60,2] </p>   <p align=\"left\"><i>Alena studuje na univerzitÄ italÂtinu a tak bude celĂŠ lĂŠto   pracovat jako&nbsp; prĹŻvodce cestovnĂ­ kancelĂĄĹe v&nbsp;ItĂĄlii. V&nbsp;zĂĄĹĂ­   chce jet s&nbsp;pĹĂ­telem do Rakouska. PlĂĄnujĂ­, Âe navÂtĂ­vĂ­ VĂ­deĹ,   Salzburg a Alpy. V&nbsp;AlpĂĄch budou chodit na tĂşry nebo jezdit na kole.</i></p>   <p align=\"left\"> [$1, textarea 60,2] </p>   <p align=\"left\"><i>V&nbsp;Äervenci pojede Pavel s&nbsp;kamarĂĄdy do Francie.   Budou cestovat stopem a spĂĄt v&nbsp;kempech. ChtÄjĂ­ navÂtĂ­vit PaĹĂ­Â a   jejĂ­ galerie, muzea a kavĂĄrny. Pojedou taky do Provance, Nice a Monaka.</i></p>   <p align=\"left\"> [$1, textarea 60,2] </p>   <p align=\"left\"><i>RodiÄe pojedou na dovolenou do KarlovĂ˝ch VarĹŻ. Budou tam   odpoÄĂ­vat, chodit na prochĂĄzky, na koncerty a pĂ­t minerĂĄlnĂ­ vodu. V&nbsp;Äervenci   je v&nbsp;KarlovĂ˝ch Varech mezinĂĄrodnĂ­ filmovĂ˝ festival, tak doufajĂ­, Âe   tam budou i hezkĂŠ filmy.</i></p>   <p align=\"left\"> [$1, textarea 60,2] </p> <h3>List verbs in the future tense.</h3> <p> [$1, textarea 60,5] </p> ', 3, ''),
(1539, 1, 'Using the Instrumental (U10)', NULL, 49, '', '<h2>Using the instrumental</h2> <h4>Translate the dialog and identify the use of the instrumental</h4> <table cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" width=\"579\" border=\"0\">   <tbody>     <tr>       <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"289\">         <p><img src=\"/tuit/img/reading/instrumental1.gif\" border=\"0\" width=\"275\" height=\"228><br>         1.  [$1, textarea 30,2] <br>         2.  [$1, textarea 30,2] </p>       </td>       <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"289\">         <p><img src=\"/tuit/img/reading/instrumental2.gif\" border=\"0\" width=\"275\" height=\"228><br>         3.  [$1, textarea 30,2] <br>         4.  [$1, textarea 30,2] </p>       </td>     </tr>   </tbody> </table> <h4>How do these three proverbs use the instrumental in a more regular way?</h4> <table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\">   <tr>     <td width=\"39%\"><img src=\"/tuit/img/reading/instrumentalproverbs.gif\" border=\"0\" width=\"263\" height=\"119></td>     <td width=\"61%\"> [$1, textarea 40,3] </td>   </tr> </table> <h4>How is the instrumental used as part of a verb in this popular Czech proverb?</h4> <table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\">   <tr>     <td width=\"50%\">       <p align=\"right\"> [$1, textarea 40,3] </td>     <td width=\"50%\"><img src=\"/tuit/img/reading/instrumentalproverbs2.gif\" border=\"0\" width=\"381\" height=\"80></td>   </tr> </table> <h4>The same principle can be found in this cartoon. Explain.</h4> <table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\">   <tr>     <td width=\"50%\"><img alt=\"Vtip dne 17.11.2000\" src=\"instrumentaljoke.gif\" border=\"0\" width=\"372\" height=\"329\"></td>     <td width=\"50%\"> [$1, textarea 40,5] </td>   </tr> </table> <p><img alt=\"Text Box: %KĂM?ÄĂM?	jet ÄĂ­m	jedu, ÂINSERT INTO `exercises` (`ex_id`, `ex_type`, `ex_name`, `ex_description`, `ex_creator`, `ex_task`, `ex_story`, `ex_difficulty`, `ex_options`) VALUES
