(1619, 1, 'Complete sentences 2 (Nouns/Case/Dative)', NULL, 49, '', '<h3>DoplĹte!</h3>  <p>Jdu ke  [$1, text 10:kamarĂĄdovi]  ( kamarĂĄd). Âkola je naproti  [$1, text 5:bance]  ( banka ). <br>  RozumĂ­m &nbsp; [$1, text 6:jazyku]  ( jazyk ), ale nerozumĂ­m  [$1, text 9:gramatice]  ( gramatika ).  <br>  ZĂ­tra zavolĂĄm &nbsp; [$1, text 5:PetĹe]  ( Petra ).Jedeme k  [$1, text 7:babiÄce]  ( babiÄka ). <br>  BydlĂ­m naproti  [$1, text 5:Âkole]  ( Âkola ).&nbsp; NerozumĂ­m tomu  [$1, text 5:filmu]  ( film ).</p>  ', 3, ''),
