(1682, 1, 'Choose correct aspect 3 (Verbs/Aspect)', NULL, 49, '', '<h3>NapiÂte sprĂĄvnÄ!</h3>  <p><b>dÄlat - udÄlat</b></p>  <p>Kdy  [$1, text 12:udÄlĂĄÂ]  ten Ăşkol ? KaÂdĂ˝ den se uÄĂ­m a &nbsp; [$1, text 12:dÄlĂĄm]  Ăşkoly.</p>  <p><b>snĂ­dat -&nbsp; nasnĂ­dat se</b></p>  <p>NaÂi uÄitelĂŠ &nbsp; [$1, text 12:snĂ­dajĂ­]  kaÂdĂ˝ den v menze. KdyÂ &nbsp; [$1, text 12:se  nasnĂ­dĂĄm)]  , jdu do Âkoly.</p>  <p><b>jet - jezdit</b></p>  <p>ZĂ­tra  [$1, text 12:jedem]  autobusem do Prahy. Jitka &nbsp; [$1, text 12:jezdĂ­]  kaÂdĂ˝ tĂ˝den  domĹŻ.</p>  <p><b>jĂ­t - chodit</b></p>  <p>Hele, Michal &nbsp; [$1, text 12:jde]  do Âkoly. DÄti &nbsp; [$1, text 12:chodĂ­]  do Âkoly od  pondÄlĂ­ do pĂĄtku.</p>  <p><b>uÄit se - nauÄit se</b></p>  <p> [$1, text 12:UÄĂ­m se]  Äesky rĂĄd. &nbsp; SlovĂ­Äka  [$1, text 12:se nauÄĂ­m]  zĂ­tra. <b>(jĂĄ)</b></p>  <p><b>kupovat -&nbsp; koupit</b></p>  <p>ZĂ­tra  [$1, text 12:koupĂ­m]  chleba. KaÂdĂ˝ den  [$1, text 12:kupuju] &nbsp;Äaj. <b>(jĂĄ)</b></p>  <p><b>psĂĄt - napsat</b></p>  <p> [$1, text 12:PĂ­Âu]  kamarĂĄdovi. Odpoledne  [$1, text 12:napĂ­Âu]  dopis domĹŻ. <b>(jĂĄ)</b></p>  <p><b>pĂ­t - napĂ­t se</b></p>  <p>V hospodÄ  [$1, text 12:piju] &nbsp;pivo. &nbsp;MĂĄm ÂĂ­zeĹ musĂ­m  [$1, text 12:se napĂ­t] . <b>(jĂĄ)</b></p>  <p><b>jĂ­st - najĂ­st se</b></p>  <p> [$1, text 12:JĂ­m]  okurku. &nbsp;AÂ  [$1, text 12:se najĂ­m]  pĹŻjdu do Âkoly. <b>(jĂĄ)</b></p>  <p><b>konÄit - skonÄit</b></p>  <p>Je 12:15, ÄeÂtina  [$1, text 12:konÄĂ­] . &nbsp;AÂ  [$1, text 12:skonÄĂ­m] &nbsp;vysokou Âkolu,  budu inÂenĂ˝r.</p>    ', 3, ''),
