(1705, 1, 'Conjugate jĂ­t (Verbs/Conjugation)', NULL, 49, '', '<h3>DoplĹte sloveso <i>jĂ­t</i>!</h3>  <ol>    <li>V 8 hodin musĂ­m &nbsp; [$1, text 4:jĂ­t]  do Âkoly.</li>    <li>Dane, &nbsp; [$1, text 4:jdeÂ]  do restaurace ?</li>    <li>V kolik hodin  [$1, text 4:jde]  Radek do kina ?</li>    <li>ZĂ­tra <b>(my) </b>ne [$1, text 5:jdeme]  do Âkoly.</li>    <li>V ĂşterĂ˝ &nbsp; [$1, text 4:jde]  Pavel do divadla.</li>    <li>My  [$1, text 5:jdeme]  domĹŻ, ale do hospody.</li>    <li>Hana, Anna a Michal &nbsp; [$1, text 4:jdou]  na veÄeĹi.</li>  </ol>   ', 3, ''),
(1706, 1, 'Conjugate and choose jĂ­t and pĹijĂ­t (Verbs/Conjugation)', NULL, 49, '', '<h3>DoplĹte slovesa! <i>JĂ­t</i> nebo <i>pĹijĂ­t</i>?</h3>  <p>ZĂ­tra  [$1, text 8:jdu]  do Âkoly v 8 hodin. <b><i>(jĂĄ) </i></b>&nbsp;DomĹŻ  [$1, text 8:pĹijdu]  v 6 hodin.<b><i>(jĂĄ)</i></b> Hana  [$1, text 8:jde]  dneska do kina. &nbsp;TĂĄta  [$1, text 8:pĹijde]  z prĂĄce pozdÄ. VÄera  [$1, text 8:Âel]  na nĂĄvÂtÄvu k Petrovi.<b><i>(on)</i></b>  &nbsp;Bolelo mÄ v krku a tak  [$1, text 8:jsem Âel)]  k doktorovi. RodiÄe k nĂĄm  [$1, text 8:pĹiÂli]  v sobotu.</p>', 3, ''),
