(1715, 1, 'Conjugate uÄit se (Verbs/Conjugation)', NULL, 49, '', '<h3>DoplĹte sloveso <i>uÄit se!</i></h3>  <p><b>(jĂĄ)</b>  [$1, text 8:UÄĂ­m se)]  anglicky. &nbsp;Petr  [$1, text 8:se uÄĂ­)]  ÂpanÄlsky.&nbsp;Vy   [$1, text 8:se uÄĂ­te)]  Äesky. &nbsp;SĂĄra a Jennifer&nbsp;  [$1, text 8:se uÄĂ­)]  francouzsky. <b>(ty)</b>&nbsp;   [$1, text 8:UÄĂ­Â se)]  Äesky nebo Francouzsky? &nbsp;<b> (vy)</b>  [$1, text 8:UÄĂ­te se)]  nÄmecky  ? Ne, &nbsp; [$1, text 8:uÄĂ­me se)]  rusky. &nbsp;<b> (ty)</b>  [$1, text 8:UÄĂ­Â se)]  anglicky ?  Ne,  [$1, text 8:uÄĂ­m se)]  Äesky. &nbsp;Jana &nbsp; [$1, text 8:se uÄĂ­m)]  Äesky. &nbsp;Co  &nbsp; [$1, text 8:se uÄĂ­Â)]  ? <b>(ty)</b></p>   ', 3, ''),
