 </td>        <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"16\">          <p>&nbsp;</p>        </td>        <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"285\">          <p> [$1, text 40] </p>        </td>      </tr>      <tr>        <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"243\">          <p><i>ZĂ­tra pĹijedu pÄÂky domĹŻ.</i></p>        </td>        <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"16\">          <p>&nbsp;</p>        </td>        <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"285\">          <p>ZĂ­tra pĹĂ­jdu pÄÂky domĹŻ.</p>        </td>      </tr>      <tr>        <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"243\">          <p><i>V restauraci si ÄistĂ­m zuby.</i></p>        </td>        <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"16\">          <p>&nbsp;</p>        </td>        <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"285\">          <p> [$1, text 40] </p>        </td>      </tr>      <tr>        <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"243\">          <p><i>Dominik je dobrĂĄ Âena.</i></p>        </td>        <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"16\">          <p>&nbsp;</p>        </td>        <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"285\">          <p> [$1, text 40] </p>        </td>      </tr>      <tr>        <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"243\">          <p><i>V kvÄtnu jsou vĂĄnoce.</i></p>        </td>        <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"16\">          <p>&nbsp;</p>        </td>        <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"285\">          <p> [$1, text 40] </p>        </td>      </tr>      <tr>        <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"243\">          <p><i>OblĂŠkĂĄm si kolo.</i></p>        </td>        <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"16\">          <p>&nbsp;</p>        </td>        <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"285\">          <p> [$1, text 40] </p>        </td>      </tr>      <tr>        <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"243\">          <p><i>JezdĂ­m na autobuse do Âkoly.</i></p>        </td>        <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"16\">          <p>&nbsp;</p>        </td>        <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"285\">          <p> [$1, text 40] </p>        </td>      </tr>      <tr>        <td vAlign=\"top\" width=\"243\">          <p><i>Sprchuju se mlĂŠke