width=\"334\">\r\n      <p><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">kterĂ˝, jakĂ˝, ÄĂ­, kdo,\r\n      co (they start a question)</span></font></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td style=\"PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; WIDTH: 40.85pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm\" vAlign=\"top\" width=\"54\">\r\n      <p>Â </p>\r\n    </td>\r\n    <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.25pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 0.25pt solid; WIDTH: 134.65pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none\" vAlign=\"top\" width=\"180\" colSpan=\"2\">\r\n      <p><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">INDEFINITE</span></font></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n    <td style=\"PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; WIDTH: 250.6pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm\" vAlign=\"top\" width=\"334\">\r\n      <p><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">nÄkdo, nÄjakĂ˝, nÄco, mĂĄlokdo,\r\n      ...</span></font></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td style=\"PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; WIDTH: 40.85pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm\" vAlign=\"top\" width=\"54\">\r\n      <p>Â </p>\r\n    </td>\r\n    <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.25pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 0.25pt solid; WIDTH: 134.65pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.25pt solid\" vAlign=\"top\" width=\"180\" colSpan=\"2\">\r\n      <p><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">NEGATIVE</span></font></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n    <td style=\"PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; WIDTH: 250.6pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm\" vAlign=\"top\" width=\"334\">\r\n      <p><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">nikdo, nic, nijakĂ˝, ÂĂĄdnĂ˝,\r\n      niÄĂ­, ...</span></font></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</table>', 1, NULL),
(1928, 6, 'Numerals Overview', '', 49, 'Numerals Overview', '<table>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td style=\"PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; WIDTH: 175.5pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm\" vAlign=\"top\" width=\"234\" colSpan=\"3\" rowSpan=\"2\">\r\n      <p><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">When we talk about\r\n      numerals, we can identify these features:</span></font></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n    <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.25pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: windowtext 0.25pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 0.25pt solid; WIDTH: 42.55pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none\" vAlign=\"top\" width=\"57\">\r\n      <p><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">CASE</span></font></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n    <td style=\"PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; WIDTH: 208pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm\" vAlign=\"top\" width=\"277\" colSpan=\"2\">\r\n      <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" align=\"left\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">as\r\n      above</span></font></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 0.25pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 0.25pt solid; WIDTH: 42.55pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.25pt solid\" vAlign=\"top\" width=\"57\">\r\n      <p><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">KIND</span></font></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n    <td style=\"PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; WIDTH: 208pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm\" vAlign=\"top\" width=\"277\" colSpan=\"2\">\r\n      <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" align=\"left\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">cardinal,\r\n      ordinal, multiplication and generic</span></font></p>\r\n    </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td style=\"PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; WIDTH: 426pt; PADDING-TOP