(2017, 1, 'Hotovo W8(84-86)', '', 58, '', '<H1>Aktivity zĂ­tra</H1>\r\n<P><IMG height=90 src=\"/tuit/img/textbook/bh-image001.gif\" width=606 align=left> </P>\r\n<P></P>\r\n<P></P>\r\n<P></P>\r\n<P></P>\r\n<H3><B>Budu bydlet v&nbsp;Praze.</B> &nbsp;</H3><IMG alt=\"\" src=\"/tuit/img/textbook/bh-obr1.gif\"> \r\n<P align=center><B><I></I></B></P>\r\n<H3>DoplĹte&nbsp; <I>bude</I> nebo <I>pĹŻjde.</I> </H3>\r\n<P><I>&nbsp;</I> <I>Kamil [$1,text 12:bude] vstĂĄvat v&nbsp;6.45. Potom [$1,text 12:bude] snĂ­dat. Potom [$1,text 12:pĹŻjde] do Âkoly a [$1,text 12:bude] se uÄit ÄeÂtinu. Potom [$1,text 12:pĹŻjde] na obÄd do restaurace. Odpoledne [$1,text 12:bude] mĂ­t ekonomii. Potom [$1,text 12:bude] nakupovat a [$1,text 12:pĹŻjde] na prochĂĄzku. VeÄer se [$1,text 12:bude] dĂ­vat na televizi.</I> </P>\r\n<P></P>\r\n<TABLE cellSpacing=0 cellPadding=0 bgColor=#ffffcc border=1>\r\n<TBODY>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD width=500 colSpan=2>\r\n<P align=center><B>2002</B> </P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD width=137>\r\n<P align=center><I>LEDEN</I> </P></TD>\r\n<TD width=421>\r\n<P><I>V lednu budu lyÂovat.</I> </P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD width=137>\r\n<P align=center><I>ĂNOR</I> </P></TD>\r\n<TD width=421>\r\n<P><I>V Ăşnoru pojedu na hory.</I> </P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD width=137>\r\n<P align=center><I>BĹEZEN</I> </P></TD>\r\n<TD width=421>\r\n<P><I>V bĹeznu budu studovat.</I> </P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD width=137>\r\n<P align=center><I>DUBEN</I> </P></TD>\r\n<TD width=421>\r\n<P><I>V dubnu budu hrĂĄt tenis.</I> </P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD width=137>\r\n<P align=center><I>KVÄTEN</I> </P></TD>\r\n<TD width=421>\r\n<P><I>V kvÄtnu budu jezdit na kole.</I> </P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD width=137>\r\n<P align=center><I>ÄERVEN</I> </P></TD>\r\n<TD width=421>\r\n<P><I>V Äervnu budu plavat.</I> </P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD width=137>\r\n<P align=center><I>ÄERVENEC</I> </P></TD>\r\n<TD width=421>\r\n<P><I>V Äervenci pojedu do ItĂĄlie.</I> </P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD width=137>\r\n<P al