NT color=#330099></FONT>&nbsp;</P></TD>\r\n<TD vAlign=top><FONT color=#330099><BR></FONT></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD align=middle width=189>\r\n<P><FONT color=#330099>vrĂĄ<B><U>tit se</U></B></FONT></P></TD>\r\n<TD align=middle width=113>\r\n<P><FONT color=#330099>vra<B><U>cet se</U></B></FONT></P></TD>\r\n<TD align=middle width=85>\r\n<P><FONT color=#330099></FONT>&nbsp;</P></TD>\r\n<TD align=middle width=19>\r\n<P><FONT color=#330099></FONT>&nbsp;</P></TD>\r\n<TD vAlign=top><FONT color=#330099><BR></FONT></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD align=middle width=189>\r\n<P><FONT color=#330099>navÂtĂ­v<B><U>it</U></B></FONT></P></TD>\r\n<TD align=middle width=113>\r\n<P><FONT color=#330099></FONT>&nbsp;</P></TD>\r\n<TD align=middle width=85>\r\n<P><FONT color=#330099></FONT>&nbsp;</P></TD>\r\n<TD vAlign=center align=middle width=19>\r\n<P><FONT color=#330099>navÂtÄv<B><U>ovat</U></B></FONT></P></TD>\r\n<TD vAlign=top><BR></TD></TR></TBODY></TABLE>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<TABLE cellSpacing=0 cellPadding=0 bgColor=#ffffcc border=1>\r\n<TBODY>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD vAlign=top width=958>\r\n<P><I><B></B></I>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P><B><FONT color=#330099 size=4>Co udÄlĂĄm zĂ­tra?!</FONT></B></P>\r\n<P><I><FONT color=#330099>ZĂ­tra budu vstĂĄvat v&nbsp;sedm hodin. Osprchuju se a budu <IMG height=58 src=\"http://www.bohemica.com/tuit/img/textbook/bk-abimage007.gif\" width=71> &nbsp;. AÂ se nasnĂ­dĂĄm, pĹŻjdu do Âkoly. Ve Âkole se budu <IMG height=62 src=\"http://www.bohemica.com/tuit/img/textbook/bk-abimage009.gif\" width=81> &nbsp;ÄeÂtinu a ekonomii. V&nbsp;poledne pĹŻjdu na obÄd. AÂ se na- <IMG height=61 src=\"http://www.bohemica.com/tuit/img/textbook/bk-abimage011.gif\" width=80> &nbsp;, vrĂĄtĂ­m se do Âkoly a budu </FONT></I></P>\r\n<P><I><FONT color=#330099>psĂĄt esej. V&nbsp;pÄt hodin pĹijdeHonza a pĹŻjdeme <IMG height=63 src=\"http://www.bohemica.com/tuit/img/textbook/bk-abimage013.gif\" width=80> &nbsp;&nbsp;nÄco k&nbsp;veÄeĹi. Potom <IMG height=64 src=\"http://www.bohemica.com/tuit/img/textbook/bk-abimage015.gif\" width=82> &nbsp;na kolej, u- <IMG height=41 src=\"http://www.bohemica.com/tuit/img/textbook/bk-abimage017.gif\" width=58> &nbsp;veÄeĹi a budeme <IMG height=67 src=\"http://www.bohemica.com/tuit/img/textbook/bk-abimage019.gif\" width=91> &nbsp;nebo <IMG height=60 src=\"http://www.bohemica.com/tuit/img/textbook/bk-abimage021.gif\" width=70> &nbsp;. V&nbsp;deset hodin chceme <IMG height=62 src=\"http://www.bohemica.com/tuit/img/textbook/bk-abimage023.gif\" width=79> &nbsp;&nbsp;na diskotĂŠku do Radosti FX.Tam budeme tancovat, bavit se a pĂ­t. AÂ se vrĂĄtĂ­me na kolej, budeme <IMG height=64 src=\"http://www.bohemica.com/tuit/img/textbook/bk-abimage025.gif\" width=85> &nbsp;, ale nesmĂ­me zaspat, protoÂe ve stĹedu zaÄĂ­najĂ­ pĹednĂĄÂky v 9 hodin.</FONT></I></P>\r\n<P><I><FONT color=#330099></FONT></I>&nbsp;</P></TD></TR></TBODY></TABLE>\r\n<P><FONT color=#330099></FONT>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<H3><FONT color=#330099>DoplĹte!</FONT></H3>\r\n<TABLE class=\"\" cellSpacing=2 cellPadding=2 bgColor=#b0c4de border=0>\r\n<TBODY>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD width=614>\r\n<P><B><FONT color=#330099>snĂ­dat - nasnĂ­dat se</FONT></B></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD width=614>\r\n<P align=left><I><FONT color=#330099>Obvykle [$1,text 15:snĂ­dĂĄm] kĂĄvu a rohlĂ­k. AÂ [$1,text 15:se nasnĂ­dĂĄm] pĹŻjdu do Âkoly.</FONT></I></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD width=614>\r\n<P><B><FONT color=#330099>uÄit se - nauÄit se</FONT></B></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD width=614>\r\n<P align=left><I><FONT color=#330099>[$1,text 15:UÄĂ­m se] Äesky rĂĄd. SlovĂ­Äka [$1,text 15:se nauÄĂ­m] zĂ­tra.</FONT></I></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD width=614>\r\n<P><B><FONT color=#330099>kupovat - koupit</FONT></B></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD width=614>\r\n<P align=left><I><FONT color=#330099>ZĂ­tra [$1,text 15:koupĂ­m] chleba. KaÂdĂ˝ den [$1,text 15:kupuju] mlĂŠko.</FONT></I></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD width=614>\r\n<P><B><FONT color=#330099>psĂĄt Â napsat</FONT></B></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD width=614>\r\n<P align=left><I><FONT color=#330099>Odpoledne [$1,text 15:napĂ­Âu] dopis kamarĂĄdovi. KaÂdĂ˝ veÄer [$1,text 15:pĂ­Âu] domĂĄcĂ­ Ăşkoly.</FONT></I></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD width=614>\r\n<P><B><FONT color=#330099>pĂ­t - napĂ­t se</FONT></B></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD width=614>\r\n<P align=left><I><FONT color=#330099>V hospodÄ [$1,text 15:piju] pivo. MĂĄm ÂĂ­zeĹ, a proto [$1,text 3:se] musĂ­m [$1,text 15:napĂ­t].</FONT></I></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD width=614>\r\n<P><B><FONT color=#330099>vaĹit Â uvaĹit</FONT></B></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD width=614>\r\n<P><I><FONT color=#330099>ZĂ­tra [$1,text 15:uvaĹĂ­m] dobrĂ˝ obÄd. KaÂdĂ˝ den musĂ­m [$1,text 15:vaĹit].</FONT></I></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD width=614>\r\n<P><B><FONT color=#330099>ÄĂ­st Â pĹeÄĂ­st</FONT></B></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD width=614>\r\n<P><I><FONT color=#330099>[$1,text 15:PĹeÄtu] ten Äasopis zĂ­tra. RĂĄda [$1,text 15:Ätu] historickĂŠ knihy.</FONT></I></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD width=614>\r\n<P><B><FONT color=#330099>spĂĄt Â zaspat</FONT></B></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD width=614>\r\n<P><I><FONT color=#330099>V pĂĄtek nesmĂ­me [$1,text 15:zaspat]. KaÂdĂ˝ den [$1,text 15:spĂ­m] osm hodin.</FONT></I></P></TD></TR></TBODY></TABLE>\r\n<H3><FONT color=#330099>NapiÂte kdy! </FONT></H3>\r\n<TABLE class=\"\" style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #c0c0c0 1px dotted; BORDER-TOP: #c0c0c0 1px dotted; BORDER-LEFT: #c0c0c0 1px dotted; WIDTH: 628px; BORDER-BOTTOM: #c0c0c0 1px dotted; HEIGHT: 355px\" cellSpacing=2 cellPadding=2 bgColor=#b0c4de border=0>\r\n<TBODY>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD width=385>\r\n<P><I><FONT color=#330099></FONT></I>&nbsp;</P></TD>\r\n<TD width=190>\r\n<P align=center><I><B><FONT color=#330099>DNES / ZĂTRA</FONT></B></I></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD width=385>\r\n<P><I><FONT color=#330099>NaveÄeĹĂ­me se v restauraci.</FONT></I></P></TD>\r\n<TD width=190>\r\n<P align=center><FONT color=#330099>[DNES/(ZĂTRA]</FONT></P></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD width=385>\