(2178, 1, 'U23/13', '', 58, '', '&nbsp; \r\n<TABLE id=table6 style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #c0c0c0 1px dotted; BORDER-TOP: #c0c0c0 1px dotted; BORDER-LEFT: #c0c0c0 1px dotted; WIDTH: 481px; BORDER-BOTTOM: #c0c0c0 1px dotted; HEIGHT: 297px\" cellPadding=2 bgColor=#ffffcc border=0>\r\n<TBODY>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD width=469 height=291>\r\n<P align=left><FONT color=#000080 size=4><B>&nbsp;</B></FONT><I><FONT color=#000080><B><FONT face=Arial><FONT size=4>Kdo chce, mus</FONT><SPAN lang=cs><FONT size=4>Ă­!</FONT></SPAN></FONT></B></FONT></I></P>\r\n<P style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" align=left><SPAN style=\"VERTICAL-ALIGN: super\"><FONT face=Arial color=#000080><SPAN lang=cs><I>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; AleÂ chce bĂ˝t doktor&nbsp; a proto musĂ­ hodnÄ studovat. KaÂdĂ˝ den v 7:30 musĂ­ jĂ­t do Âkoly&nbsp; a uÄit se biologii a chemii. Obvykle </I></SPAN></FONT></SPAN><SPAN style=\"VERTICAL-ALIGN: super\"><FONT face=Arial><IMG height=84 src=\"http://www.bohemica.com/tuit/img/textbook/as-image024.gif\" width=111 align=left border=0></FONT></SPAN><SPAN style=\"VERTICAL-ALIGN: super\"><FONT face=Arial><FONT color=#000080><SPAN lang=cs><I>musĂ­ odpoled</I></SPAN></FONT><FONT color=#000080><SPAN lang=cs><I>ne studovat a pĹipravovat se do Âkoly. ObÄas j</I></SPAN></FONT></FONT></SPAN><SPAN style=\"VERTICAL-ALIGN: super\"><FONT face=Arial color=#000080><SPAN lang=cs><I>de hrĂĄt fotbal nebo tenis, ale potom musĂ­ studovat veÄer.</I></SPAN></FONT></SPAN><SPAN style=\"VERTICAL-ALIGN: super\"><FONT face=Arial color=#000080><SPAN lang=cs><I>Dnes musĂ­ mĂ­t Ăşkoly hotovĂŠ v devatenĂĄct hodin, protoÂe chce jĂ­t na koncert ÄeskĂŠ filharmonie do Rudolfina.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; O