(2299, 1, 'U43/4', '', 58, '', '<h1><font color=\"#330099\">DovolenĂĄ</font>\r\n</h1>\r\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"3\" width=\"77%\" border=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"100%\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\"><font color=\"#330099\"><i>DovolenĂĄ</i>\r\n<br />\r\n<i>BlĂ­ÂĂ­ se lĂŠto. Svobodovi plĂĄnujĂ­ dovolenou. Obvykle jezdĂ­ v&nbsp;lĂŠtÄ spoleÄnÄ k&nbsp;moĹi, ale letos strĂĄvĂ­ dovolenou v&nbsp;ÄechĂĄch.</i>\r\n<br />\r\n<i>Jejich dÄti, Alena a Pavel, chtÄjĂ­ strĂĄvit prĂĄzdniny bez rodiÄĹŻ.</i>\r\n<br />\r\n<i>Alena studuje na univerzitÄ italÂtinu a tak bude celĂŠ lĂŠto pracovat jako&nbsp; prĹŻvodce cestovnĂ­ kancelĂĄĹe v&nbsp;ItĂĄlii. V&nbsp;zĂĄĹĂ­ chce jet s&nbsp;pĹĂ­telem do Rakouska. PlĂĄnujĂ­, Âe navÂtĂ­vĂ­ VĂ­deĹ, Salzburg a Alpy. V&nbsp;AlpĂĄch budou chodit na tĂşry nebo jezdit na kole.</i>\r\n<br />\r\n<i>V&nbsp;Äervenci pojede Pavel s&nbsp;kamarĂĄdy do Francie. Budou cestovat stopem a spĂĄt v&nbsp;kempech. ChtÄjĂ­ navÂtĂ­vit PaĹĂ­Â a jejĂ­ galerie, muzea a kavĂĄrny. Pojedou taky do Provance, Nice a Monaka.</i>\r\n<br />\r\n<i>RodiÄe pojedou na dovolenou do KarlovĂ˝ch VarĹŻ. Budou tam odpoÄĂ­vat, chodit na prochĂĄzky, na koncerty a pĂ­t minerĂĄlnĂ­ vodu. V&nbsp;Äervenci je v&nbsp;KarlovĂ˝ch Varech mezinĂĄrodnĂ­ filmovĂ˝ festival, tak doufajĂ­, Âe uvidĂ­ i hezkĂŠ filmy.</i>\r\n</font>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><font color=\"#330099\" size=\"4\"><strong>OdpovÄzte!</strong>\r\n</font>\r\n</p>\r\n<table style=\"HEIGHT: 170px\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"692\" bgcolor=\"#b0c4de\" border=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td valign=\"bottom\" width=\"382\"><font face=\"Arial\" color=\"#330099\"><i>Kam jezdĂ­ obvykle Svobodovi na dovolenou?</i>\r\n</font>\r\n</td>\r\n<td valign=\"bottom\" width=\"40%\"><font color=\"#330099\">&nbsp;[$1,text 40]</font>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td valign=\"bottom\" width=\"382\"><font face=\"Arial\" color=\"#330099\"><i>Kde strĂĄvĂ­ dovolenou letos?</i>\r\n</font>\r\n</td>\r\n<td valign=\"bottom\" width=\"40%\"><font color=\"#330099\">&nbsp;[$1,text 40]</font>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td valign=\"bottom\" width=\"382\"><font face=\"Arial\" color=\"#330099\"><i>Co bude v&nbsp;Äervenci v KarlovĂ˝ch Varech?</i>\r\n</font>\r\n</td>\r\n<td valign=\"bottom\" width=\"40%\"><font color=\"#330099\">&nbsp;[$1,text 40]</font>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td valign=\"bottom\" width=\"382\"><font face=\"Arial\" color=\"#330099\"><i>Co budou dÄlat Svobodovi o dovolenĂŠ?</i>\r\n</font>\r\n</td>\r\n<td valign=\"bottom\" width=\"40%\"><font color=\"#330099\">&nbsp;[$1,text 40]</font>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td valign=\"bottom\" width=\"382\"><font face=\"Arial\" color=\"#330099\"><i>Kde studuje Alena?</i>\r\n</font>\r\n</td>\r\n<td valign=\"bottom\" width=\"40%\"><font color=\"#330099\">&nbsp;[$1,text 40]</font>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td valign=\"bottom\" width=\"382\"><font face=\"Arial\" color=\"#330099\"><i>Kdy chce jet Alena Do Rakouska?</i>\r\n</font>\r\n</td>\r\n<td valign=\"bottom\" width=\"40%\"><font color=\"#330099\">&nbsp;[$1,text 40]</font>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td valign=\"bottom\" width=\"382\"><font face=\"Arial\" color=\"#330099\"><i>Kam pojede Pavel?</i>\r\n</font>\r\n</td>\r\n<td valign=\"bottom\" width=\"40%\"><font color=\"#330099\">&nbsp;[$1,text 40]</font>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr><td valign=\"bottom\" width=\"382\"><font face=\"Arial\" color=\"#330099\"><i>Co chtÄjĂ­ Svobodovi vidÄt?</i>\r\n</font>\r\n</td>\r\n<td valign=\"bottom\" width=\"40%\"><font color=\"#330099\">&nbsp;[$1,text 40]</font>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n', 3, NULL),
