(624, 13, 'glo mcmillan', 'glomc@DakotaCom.net', 'uses of \"uÂ\"', 'I hear people saying \"uÂ\"...\"uÂ\"  all the time in Czech when I\r\nlisten to them speak.   It ounds as frequent as \"tak\", so what\r\ndoes it mean when used--as it seems to be--as a particle or an\r\nintrojection?\r\n\r\nDekuji,\r\n\r\nGloria\r\n\r\n\r\nI still had trouble using Netscape--no text box.', '2002-08-10 19:36:10', 0, 1),
