(691, 17, 'ÂtÄpĂĄnka PfeiferovĂĄ', 'rekat@volny.cz', 'Re: Jakto Âe nikdo nemĂĄ zĂĄjem?', 'OracĂ­m se na vĂĄs s prosbou. MĹŻj letitĂ˝ pĹĂ­tel z Egypta(ÂijĂ­cĂ­ tamtĂŠÂ) je nucen se nauÄit Äesky dokonaleji, neÂ v souÄasnĂŠ dobÄ zvlĂĄdĂĄ a poprosil mÄ o pomoc. PotĹebuje kazety s vĂ˝ukou ÄeÂtiny v ArabÂtinÄ, pĹĂ­padnÄ v AngliÄtinÄ. BohuÂel jsem zatĂ­m nebyla ĂşspÄÂnĂĄ v hledĂĄnĂ­ tohoto produktu a tak se obracĂ­m s prosbou na VĂĄs. Pokud vĂ­te o takovĂŠm jazykovĂŠm kurzu, prosĂ­m kontaktujte mÄ na uvedenĂŠm E-mailu. PĹedem dÄkuji ÂtÄpĂĄnka PfeiferovĂĄ ', '2002-09-23 00:10:17', 583, 0),
(692, 16, 'ÂtÄpĂĄnka PfeiferovĂĄ', 'rekat @volny.cz', 'pomĹŻÂe mi prosĂ­m nÄkdo??', 'ObracĂ­m se na VĂĄs s prosbou. MĹŻj letitĂ˝ pĹĂ­tel z Egypta( ÂijĂ­cĂ­ tamtĂŠÂ) je nucen se nauÄit Äesky dokonaleji, neÂ v souÄasnĂŠ dobÄ zvlĂĄdĂĄ a poprosil mÄ o pomoc. PotĹebuje kazety s vĂ˝ukou ÄeÂtiny v ArabÂtinÄ, pĹĂ­padnÄ v AngliÄtinÄ. BohuÂel jsem zatĂ­m nebyla ĂşspÄÂnĂĄ v hledĂĄnĂ­ tohoto produktu a tak se obracĂ­m na VĂĄs. Pokud o takovĂŠm kurzu vĂ­te, kontaktujte mÄ prosĂ­m na e-mail: rekat@volny.cz\r\nPĹedem dÄkuji        ÂtÄpĂĄnka PfeiferovĂĄ', '2002-09-23 00:29:32', 0, 0),
(693, 13, 'VladimĂ­r', '', 'Re: SkloĹovĂĄnĂ­ podstatnĂ˝ch jmen.', 'DveĹe, Âen. rod (pomnoÂnĂŠ!):\r\ndveĹe, dveĹĂ­, dveĹĂ­m, dveĹe, dveĹe!, (o) dveĹĂ­ch, dveĹmi.\r\n\r\nPrĂĄce, Âen. rod:\r\nprĂĄce, prĂĄce, prĂĄci, prĂĄci, prĂĄce!, (o) prĂĄci, pracĂ­;\r\nprĂĄce, pracĂ­, pracĂ­m, prĂĄce, prĂĄce!, (o) pracĂ­ch, pracemi.\r\n\r\nPenĂ­ze, muÂ. rod, mn. ÄĂ­slo:\r\npenĂ­ze, penÄz, penÄzĹŻm, penĂ­ze, penĂ­ze!, (o) penÄzĂ­ch, penÄzi.\r\n\r\nPenĂ­z (= jednotlivĂĄ mince), muÂ. rod, skloĹuje se jako STROJ:\r\npenĂ­z, penĂ­ze, penĂ­zi, penĂ­z, penĂ­zi!, (o) penĂ­zi, penĂ­zem;\r\npenĂ­ze, penĂ­zĹŻ, penĂ­zĹŻm, penĂ­ze, penĂ­ze!, (o) penĂ­zĂ­ch, penĂ­zi.', '2002-09-23 16:45:28', 687, 0),
(694, 13, 'VladimĂ­r', '', 'Re: Verb: doruÄit', 'to deliver a letter = doruÄit (odevzdat, pĹedat) dopis\r\nto deliver a speech = pronĂŠst ĹeÄ\r\n\r\nKdo pronesl vÄera tu ĹeÄ?\r\nPronese zĂ­tra nĂĄÂ president ĹeÄ?\r\n', '2002-09-23 17:02:27', 688, 0),
(695, 17, 'Dominator', '', 'Re: jak bude sprĂĄvnÄ...?', 'ja myslim ze lide zapomenili na to ze jazk je ziva vec a ze my jenom zbirame pravidla aby pomohli nasim snaham ji ucit a pri denim puoziti vetsina techto pravidel jsou ignorovani. Jako Prazak ja rikam vetsinou Vopravdu misto Opravdu', '2002-09-24 22:55:45', 588, 0),
(696, 17, 'Dominato', '', 'NEJLEPSI FILM', 'Muj obilebny cesky film je Cisaruv Pekar z Janem Werichem, a take mam rad Ucho, nevim kdo byl reziser a kdo v nem hral ale je to fakt spicka. \r\nAle abych pravdu rek nejradsi mam rad Medvidky, Potkali se u Kolina. Ted zrovna nevim kdo to udelal, je to od bratri v tricku. Ale je to produkt \"maleho naroda\" (Slova Capka) a muzeme na to byt hrdy. \r\nNi Zjisk Ni Slavu', '2002-09-24 23:00:59', 429, 0),
(697, 17, 'micval', 'micval@centrum.cz', 'Re: NEJLEPSI FILM', 'Myslim, ze v Uchu hrali hlavni role Radoslav (?) Brzobohaty s Jirinou Bohdalovou..', '2002-09-25 01:52:03', 696, 0),
(698, 13, 'Dominik LukeÂ', 'forum@bohemica.com', 'Re: Zpravy', '\"SedmĂŠho ĹĂ­jna budu obhajovat svou disertaci, a jestli ji obhĂĄjĂ­m, obdrÂĂ­m v prosinci titul PhD.\"\r\n\r\nHodnÄ ÂtÄstĂ­!', '2002-09-26 21:22:52', 689, 0),
(699, 16, 'Dominik LukeÂ', 'forum@bohemica.com', 'Re: pomĹŻÂe mi prosĂ­m nÄkdo??', 'VÂechny kurzu a materiĂĄly, o kterĂ˝ch vĂ­m, mĹŻÂete najĂ­t v sekci Bookstore na Bohemica.com.', '2002-09-26 21:24:29', 692, 0),
(700, 13, 'loverman', 'lovermann@seznam.cz', 'pomozte mi, prosĂ­m, pĹeloÂit..', 'NemĹŻÂu nidke najĂ­t, co znamenĂĄ slova: \r\n\r\n1) brazolety, \r\n2) hobrovĂ˝ cynik, \r\n3) za faguli Âivenou  zĂĄpadem slunce\r\n4) uzpĂ­vanĂŠ Âkeble\r\n5) PejzatĂ˝\r\n6) rozparek od KniÂete  \r\n7) s poÄetnĂ˝m komonstvem\r\n8) jdu domĹŻ vohĂĄknout\r\n9) Jeho hogerovsky mÄkkĂ˝ hlas ( co znamenĂĄ hogerovskĂ˝ )\r\n\r\nsÄkuji vÂem za pomoc', '2002-09-28 16:25:33', 0, 1),
(701, 13, 'VladimĂ­r', '', 'Re: pomozte mi, prosĂ­m, pĹeloÂit..', 'Brazoleta (z franc. bracelet) = nĂĄramek; brazolety = nĂĄramky, t.j. pouta (argot)\r\n\r\nHobra = deska lisovanĂĄ z dĹev. zbytkĹŻ (zkr. podle vĂ˝robce Holzindustrie Braunau), spojenĂ­ s cynikem nejasnĂŠ\r\n\r\nFagule nebo fakule, z lat. facula, to je zdrobnÄlina z fax = pochodeĹ, louÄ; za fakuli Âivenou ...  nejspĂ­Â nÄjakĂĄ bĂĄsnickĂĄ metafora\r\n\r\nUzpĂ­vanĂ˝, patrnÄ novotvar podle vzoru \"ukĹiÄenĂ˝\", \"upovĂ­danĂ˝\"; uzpĂ­vanĂŠ Âkeble = neustĂĄle (moÂnĂĄ aÂ protivnÄ) zpĂ­vajĂ­cĂ­ mlÂi\r\n\r\nPejzy (z hebr.) = vlasy na skrĂĄnĂ­ch ortodoxnĂ­ch ÂidĹŻ; pejzatĂ˝ = patrnÄ nÄjakĂ˝ ortodoxnĂ­ Âid\r\n\r\nRozparek (od slovesa \"rozpĂĄrati) = rozpĂĄranĂĄ (Äasto ĂşmyslnÄ neseÂitĂĄ) ÄĂĄst Âvu odÄvu, spojenĂ­ s knĂ­Âetem nejasnĂŠ\r\n\r\nS poÄetnĂ˝m komonstvem (archaicky) = s poÄetnou druÂinou\r\n\r\nJdu se domĹŻ vohĂĄknout = (argot) jdu se domĹŻ (pÄknÄ) oblĂŠci\r\n\r\nHĂśgerovsky (s umlautem) = jako Karel HĂśger, ÄeskĂ˝ herec\r\n', '2002-10-01 14:16:01', 700, 0),
(702, 14, 'hillbillymama', 'hillbillymama@msn.com', 'Lived in czech', 'I meet someone that was born in the czech republic and we meet in 1992\r\nhis mom lives in europe i am happy i found thid site shes not doing good and i want to get a nice card and in my own words i want her to know i love her she knows germany but i want to do the card in czech i was there for 6 years i even have photos and just got a scanner for my birthday so i hope to get some up on my web page well i hope you that have been there enjoyed it as much as me and the ones that well visit there its very nice and peacefull nothing like being in the us not at all ', '2002-10-01 14:59:14', 0, 1),
(703, 17, 'nadka', 'katzerova@hotmail.com', 'Re: NEJLEPSI FILM', 'PĹĂ­bÄhy medvĂ­dkĹŻ, kteĹĂ­ se potkali u KolĂ­na, byly moje oblĂ­benĂŠ, kdyÂ jsem byla malĂĄ ... a mĂĄm je poĹĂĄd stejnÄ rĂĄda, i kdyÂ uÂ jsem starÂĂ­. :)))\r\nSprĂĄvnĂ˝ nĂĄzev pohĂĄdek je \"PojÄte pane, budeme si hrĂĄt!\" a natoÄil je reÂisĂŠr BĹetislav Pojar.\r\n\r\nZdravĂ­m vÂechny, kteĹĂ­ majĂ­ stĂĄle rĂĄdi pohĂĄdky!! :)) ', '2002-10-02 20:00:06', 696, 0),
(704, 13, 'Craig', 'sapphyre12@aol.com', 'Czech Bible', 'DOes anyone know where I can get a Czech Bible', '2002-10-05 12:39:01', 0, 0),
(705, 13, 'Dominik Lukes', 'forum@bohemica.com', 'Re: Czech Bible', 'You can download the text for free at <a href=http://www.theophilos.sk>http://www.theophilos.sk</a>. You get several translations of the Bible (old and modern) and the ability to compare King James with other translations. Very flexible software.', '2002-10-05 13:41:36', 704, 0),
(706, 14, 'Kim', 'bigbear@globalccs.net', 'Shipping Vehicles', 'Hi!  Does anyone out there have any recommendations about shipping a vehicle from the U.S. to either Amsterdam or Germany?  A friend of mine will be moving home (Czech Republic) in two weeks and I need to find a reliable and reasonably priced company.  Any help or advice would be appreciated!\r\n\r\nThanks.\r\n\r\nKim', '2002-10-11 23:08:39', 0, 1),
(707, 13, 'Lorenzo', 'exilems72@hotmail.com', 'PĹeklad', 'I need a little help translating one simple sentence into Czech:\r\n\"I\'d like to write about his new song\"\r\nI have had a try at translating it myself. So here\'s what I have come up with:\r\n\"ChtÄl bych psat o svĹŻj novy pĂ­seĹ\"\r\nCan anyone tell me if this is correct?\r\n\r\nThank you for your help!\r\n\r\nLorenzo', '2002-10-12 22:50:43', 0, 0),
(708, 13, 'VladimĂ­r', '', 'Re: PĹeklad', '\"svĹŻj\" = reflexive possesive pronoun\r\n\r\nChtÄl bych psĂĄt o SVĂ novĂŠ pĂ­sni. = ... about MY new song.\r\nChtÄl bych psĂĄt o JEHO novĂŠ pĂ­sni. = ... about HIS new song.\r\n\r\nNow I have discovered that I cannot translate into English:\r\n\r\nOn by chtÄl psĂĄt o SVĂ novĂŠ pĂ­sni. He\'d like to write about ??? new song.\r\nOn by chtÄl psĂĄt o JEHO novĂŠ pĂ­sni.          -\"-            ???   -\"-    ', '2002-10-14 14:40:14', 707, 0),
(709, 14, 'nadka', 'katzerova@hotmail.com', 'Re: Shipping Vehicles', 'Hi,\r\nI have seen this topic to be discussed at Expats forum recently. \r\nTry to have a look there, the address is: www.expats.cz\r\n\r\nRgds,  Nadka', '2002-10-14 20:12:40', 706, 0),
(710, 13, 'Lorenzo', '', 'Re: PĹeklad', 'Thank you VladimĂ­r!\r\nNow it\'s clear! I think you can translate \"svĹŻj\" as \"one\'s own\".\r\n\r\nOn by chtÄl psĂĄt o SVĂ novĂŠ pĂ­sni. He\'d like to write about HIS (own) new song. \r\nOn by chtÄl psĂĄt o JEHO novĂŠ pĂ­sni. -\"- HIS -\"-', '2002-10-16 00:00:09', 708, 0),
(711, 13, 'VladimĂ­r', '', 'Re: PĹeklad', 'Mr. X wrote Mr. Y about his new song.\r\n\r\nWho is the author of the song?\r\n\r\nIn Latin and Slavic languages:\r\nreflexive possesive pronoun suus/svĹŻj - Mr. X (subject)\r\n3rd possesive pronoun eius/jeho - Mr. Y (object of the sentence)\r\n\r\n', '2002-10-16 16:37:41', 710, 0),
(712, 13, 'marjolein', 'marjoleinkloet@hotmail.com', 'can someone translate for me please?', 'In the summer of 2001 I went for a holiday to the Czech Republic and I\r\nvisited Praha. In Praha I found in a little old bookstore a kind of saving\r\naccounts book of a pawnbroking business or a savings bank, I don\'t know. This book was from Ruzena NovĂĄkovĂĄ and this book was from 1924 to 1945. I\'ve heard this kind of bussiness was illegal during the comminist period, that\'s maybe why this book stopped at 1945. \r\n\r\nOn the front of the book is printed VkladnĂ­ knĂ­zka. VseobecnĂŠ zĂĄlozny\r\nv KarlĂ­ne. Could someone translate that and tell me if it is a savings bank book or book of the pwnbraking business\r\nI found out that KarlĂ­n is a quarter in Praha. \r\n\r\nYours \r\nMarjolein\r\n', '2002-10-17 16:48:44', 0, 1),
(713, 13, 'V.P.', '', 'Re: can someone translate for me please?', 'Savings (depositor\'s) book of General savings bank in KarlĂ­n.', '2002-10-17 17:52:20', 712, 0),
(714, 14, 'MJ Sharp', 'mjsharp@earthlink.net', 'Czech artist info?', 'I spent a month in Prague a year ago and while there I acquired a tiny watercolor sketch that I  found in a used/antique bookstore. It was done in 1960 by Zdenek Holub. I would love to find more information about him.  I was able to find out that he was a student of Fisarek and that he did the stained glass window at the Cheb railway station. He lived from 1927-1995. I\'ve looked at libraries here for any more information about him, and while I\'ve found some books on different periods of contemporary Czech art, I haven\\\'t found anything about him.  Does anyone out there know of any resources that I could access about 20th century Czech artists? I\\\'m located in the U.S. but have a good internet connection.  Any thoughts?  Thanks very much!\r\n MJ\r\n', '2002-10-18 19:22:35', 0, 1),
(715, 13, 'lovermann', 'lovermann@seznam.cz', 'skonovĂĄnĂ­ podstatnĂ˝ch jmen muÂskĂŠho rodu', 'VĂ­m, Âe vedle koncovky -Ă­ch, bĂ˝vĂĄ v 6. p. mn. ÄĂ­sla koncovka -ĂĄch u zdrobnÄlĂ˝ch podstatnĂ˝ch jmen zakonÄenĂ˝ch na -Äek, napĹ. v balĂ­ÄcĂ­ch - v balĂ­ÄkĂĄch, a u nÄkterĂ˝ch podstatnĂ˝ch jmen na -ek, napĹ. v kouscĂ­ch - v kouskĂĄch. \r\n\r\nA mĹŻj dotaz je jak s tĂ­m v rodÄ stĹednĂ­m? Jak bude sprĂĄvnÄ: (mÄsteÄko) - v mÄsteÄkĂĄch nebo ve mÄsteÄcĂ­ch?', '2002-10-20 16:37:54', 0, 1),
(716, 13, 'VladimĂ­r', 'bohaemus@email.cz', 'SkloĹovĂĄnĂ­ podstatnĂ˝ch jmen stĹednĂ­ho rodu.', 'Ve stĹednĂ­m rodu (i rodÄ) je tomu jinak:\r\n\r\nZdrobnÄlĂĄ podst.jm. stĹ.rodu na \"-ko\" majĂ­ v 6.p.mn.Ä. koncovku \"-ĂĄch\", nezdrobnÄlĂĄ majĂ­ \"-Ă­ch\" i \"-ĂĄch\".\r\n\r\nNapĹ.:\r\njablko - jablkĂĄch i jablcĂ­ch\r\nstĹedisko - stĹediskĂĄch i stĹediscĂ­ch\r\noko - okĂĄch (duĂĄl oÄĂ­ch!)\r\nale\r\njablĂ­Äko - jablĂ­ÄkĂĄch\r\noÄiÄko - oÄiÄkĂĄch\r\nmÄsteÄko - mÄsteÄkĂĄch\r\n\r\nKoncovku \"-ĂĄch\" majĂ­ takĂŠ slova na \"-cho\", \"-go\" (asi takĂŠ na \"-ho\"):\r\nroucho - rouchĂĄch (6.p.jedn.Ä. rouchu i rouÂe)\r\nucho - uchĂĄch (duĂĄl uÂĂ­ch!)\r\ntango - tangĂĄch\r\n(slovo zakonÄenĂŠ na \"-ho\" mÄ nenapadĂĄ :-)\r\n\r\n\r\n', '2002-10-22 19:15:09', 715, 0),
(717, 13, 'john', 'jnottle@internode.on.net', 'Polednice', 'Does anyone know where I can find an English translation, on the Web, of Polednice (The Noon Witch) by J.Erben.', '2002-10-23 12:05:28', 0, 0),
