(754, 13, 'Erik Piper', 'erik@NOSPAMsky.cz', 'Re: vertaling', '(Why is it 3/4 of the posts here ask for translations of pick-up lines and love letters?)\r\n\r\nLituji, holÄiÄko hezkĂĄ, ale jsi holkou mĂ˝ch snĹŻ.\r\n\r\nSounds rather strange, but that can be charming some of the time...\r\n\r\nErik', '2002-11-28 17:47:17', 747, 0),
