(845, 15, 'Dominik LukeÂ', 'forum@bohemica.com', 'Re: scott.brown@ilovejesus.net', 'Dear Scott,\r\nthe opening of the course is just getting postponed and postponed. The technology is in place but it\'s hard to find people who would actually sit down and finish the job. I\'m doing many different things so I don\'t quite have time to be the person to do it. However, a lot more is available now than there used to be. Why don\'t you try <a href=http://www.bohemica.com/publicaccess>http://www.bohemica.com/publicaccess</a> to get a bit of a look at what the future may hold. If you\'ve signed up, you\'re on our mailing list and the minute something more is available, you will know!\r\n\r\nDominik', '2003-02-20 14:17:04', 844, 0),
(846, 16, 'Dominik LukeÂ', 'forum@bohemica.com', 'Re: Nic se tady nedÄje :-(', 'To zĂĄleÂĂ­ jenom na vĂĄs. Jestli mĂĄte nÄjakĂŠ zajĂ­mavĂŠ tĂŠma, napiÂte sem o nÄm a snad se rozvine nÄjakĂĄ diskuze!\r\n\r\nDominik\r\n\r\nPS: RĂĄd bych vĂĄm obÄma podÄkoval za enthusiasmus a pomoc, kterou poskytujete lidem na tomto foru.', '2003-02-20 14:19:36', 841, 0),
(847, 16, 'Erik Piper', 'erik@sky.cz', 'Re: Nic se tady nedÄje :-(', 'Ahoj Scotte!\r\n\r\n\"NedÄje se\" znamenĂĄ doslova \"(it) is not happening\", ovÂem pĹesnĂ˝ pĹeklad bude vÂdycky zĂĄleÂet na tom, co vyÂaduje danĂĄ situace a vÄta.\r\n\r\n(Even assuming I used correct Czech, that was a bit complicated, so: \r\n\r\nWord-for-word, \"nedÄje se\" means \"(it) is not happening\". However, the precise translation will always depend on what the given situation and sentence demand.\r\n\r\nNapĹĂ­klad:\r\nNic se tady nedÄje - Nothing\'s going on around here.\r\nNedÄje se nÄco, milĂĄÄku? - Is... something... wrong, dear?\r\nDÄjou se tady velkĂ˝ vÄci - Big stuff is happenin\'/goin\' on around here.\r\nCO SE DÄJE?! - WHAT\'S HAPPENING?! AArrghHH\r\n\r\nErik', '2003-02-20 16:21:49', 843, 0),
(848, 16, 'Erik Piper', 'erik@sky.cz', 'Re: zabloudilĂĄ konverzace', 'Mimochodem... pĹŻvodnĂ­ pĹĂ­spÄvka byla do fora \"ÄeskĂĄ konverzace\", zabloudila se sem kvĹŻli buginÄ (ehm, programovĂŠ chybÄ). Nechci ÂÂourat, jenom chci ĹĂ­ct, Âe ta\'y to nepĂ­Âu do \"teachers\" schvĂĄlnÄ.\r\n\r\nP.S. DĂ­ky Dominike, Âe tak dobĹe snĂĄÂĂ­Â mojĂ­ lenost ohlednÄ tÄch ÄlĂĄnku. Ars longa vita brevis... \r\n\r\nErik', '2003-02-20 16:24:53', 847, 1),
