(1165, 16, 'Philip', 'kielhurn@mbox.dkm.cz', 'ÄestinĂĄ', 'wish to find someone (Czech) that wants to improve on their English in exchange for Czech lessons. Prefer someone young that still has the cases in their head fresh! Older Czechs Ive met tend to have forgotten about them:{ \r\n(its normal) Write if in Prague', '2003-10-29 00:43:27', 0, 1),
(1166, 16, 'Milan', 'brozmilan@seznam.cz', 'Re: ÄestinĂĄ', 'Dear Philip\r\non provided you send me an e-mail to my address brozmilan@quick.cz,I may solve your problem.Or you can call me 732 717 299,I\'ll tell you more.Bye\r\nMilan', '2003-10-29 03:46:33', 1165, 0),
