(1900, 13, 'Henri Ahrends', '', 'Re: Translation af birthformular', 'I\'m trying to find my family who was living in Czech under the 2.WW\r\nthey escaped to Germany in 1945.\r\n\r\nThe name of my father was Frantisek Weis and maybe Reznik,\r\nwe don\'t know what Reznik means, maybe it\'s a surname ?\r\nmy mothers name was Inger Irene Weisova Rodem S&#248;nders&#248;wa ...\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n', '2006-09-20 21:20:42', 1899, 0),
(1901, 13, 'V', '', 'Re: Translation af birthformular', 'ĹeznĂ­k means Butcher, it is a common Czech surname.\r\n\"rodem\" means something like nĂŠe (maiden surname)', '2006-09-25 15:29:34', 1900, 0),
(1902, 13, 'Henri Ahrends', '', 'Re: Translation af birthformular', 'Thanx a lot, now I know a little more ...', '2006-09-25 23:32:04', 1900, 0),
(1903, 13, 'Eugeniy', 'Eugeniy.Reshetov@gmail.com', 'Typ Potrubi: Hrdlove (Does it mean axial seamweld pipe, or it means spiral weld pipe?)', 'Dears,\r\n\r\nPlease help to translate :-((((((((((((((((((((((((((((((((\r\n\r\nTyp Potrubi: Hrdlove \r\n\r\n(Does it mean axial seamweld pipe, or it means spiral weld pipe?) \r\n\r\nthanx in advance', '2006-09-26 16:28:12', 0, 1),
(1904, 13, 'voipvoip', 'forexgirls@yahoo.co.uk', 'All about VoIP', '\r\nThe Internet Protocol (IP) was originally designed for data networking. The success of IP in becoming a world standard for data networking has led to its adaption to voice networking. VoIP has become popular largely because of the cost advantages to consumers over traditional telepone networks. Most Americans pay a flat monthly fee for local telephone calls and a per-minute charge for long-distance calls.\r\n\r\n<a href=http://voip.04suf3.com/vonage-voip.html>vonage voip</a>\r\n\r\n<a href=http://voip.04suf3.com/voip-service-provider.html>voip service provider</a>\r\n\r\n<a href=http://voip.04suf3.com/voip-switching.html>voip switching</a>\r\n\r\n<a href=http://voip.04suf3.com/voip-carrier.html>voip carrier</a>\r\n\r\n<a href=http://voip.04suf3.com/voip-billing.html>voip billing</a>\r\n\r\n<a href=http://voip.04suf3.com/buster-voip.html>buster voip</a>\r\n\r\n<a href=http://voip.04suf3.com/voip-telefonia.html>voip telefonia</a>\r\n\r\n<a href=http://voip.04suf3.com/voip-business-phone.html>voip business phone</a>\r\n\r\n<a href=http://voip.04suf3.com/voip-news.html>voip news</a>\r\n\r\n<a href=http://voip.04suf3.com/wifi-voip-phone.html>wifi voip phone</a>\r\ncheck this voip sites\r\n\r\n\r\n', '2006-09-29 17:06:25', 0, 0),
(1905, 13, 'J', '', 'Re: Typ Potrubi: Hrdlove (Does it mean axial seamweld pipe, or it means spiral weld pipe?)', 'I\'m not sure whether type of welding can be deducted from the name. I think it only means \"pipe with socket joints\". Try Google - Search images - and see what you can find.\r\n\r\nOr use directly the following link:\r\nhttp://images.google.cz/images?svnum=10&hl=cs&lr=&q=potrub%C3%AD+hrdlov%C3%A9\r\n\r\n', '2006-09-29 18:26:17', 1903, 0);
